},{"word":"like","start":374.74,"end":375.02},{"word":"Daniel","start":375.02,"end":375.42},{"word":"to","start":375.42,"end":376.44},{"word":"see","start":376.44,"end":376.68},{"word":"if","start":376.68,"end":376.88},{"word":"the","start":376.88,"end":377.02},{"word":"plank","start":377.02,"end":377.32},{"word":"relieves","start":377.32,"end":378.12},{"word":"pain.","start":378.12,"end":378.56}],"textKo":"현재 저는 다니엘과 같은 사람들을 대상으로 펜플랭크 운동이 통증 완화에 도움이 되는지 확인하는 연구를 설계 중입니다.","listenDifficulty":2},{"index":77,"start":378.56,"end":389.46,"textEn":"Daniel suffers from a very rare condition known as Complex Regional Pain Syndrome, or CRPS,","words":[{"word":"Daniel","start":378.56,"end":380.12},{"word":"suffers","start":380.12,"end":380.6},{"word":"from","start":380.6,"end":380.94},{"word":"a","start":380.94,"end":381.08},{"word":"very","start":381.08,"end":381.38},{"word":"rare","start":381.38,"end":381.76},{"word":"condition","start":381.76,"end":382.38},{"word":"known","start":382.38,"end":383.42},{"word":"as","start":383.42,"end":383.74},{"word":"Complex","start":383.74,"end":384.3},{"word":"Regional","start":384.3,"end":385.36},{"word":"Pain","start":385.36,"end":386.04},{"word":"Syndrome,","start":386.04,"end":387.24},{"word":"or","start":387.68,"end":388.28},{"word":"CRPS,","start":388.28,"end":389.46}],"textKo":"다니엘은 복합 지역 통증 증후군(CRPS, Complex Regional Pain Syndrome)이라는 매우 드문 질환을 앓고 있습니다.","listenDifficulty":1},{"index":78,"start":390.12,"end":394.52,"textEn":"Which is infamous as one of the most painful diseases.","words":[{"word":"which","start":390.12,"end":390.74},{"word":"is","start":390.74,"end":390.96},{"word":"infamous","start":390.96,"end":391.54},{"word":"as","start":391.54,"end":392.46},{"word":"one","start":392.46,"end":392.64},{"word":"of","start":392.64,"end":392.74},{"word":"the","start":392.74,"end":392.88},{"word":"most","start":392.88,"end":393.2},{"word":"painful","start":393.2,"end":393.74},{"word":"diseases.","start":393.74,"end":394.52}],"tex