 0으로 초기화되고","listenDifficulty":1},{"index":110,"start":378.0,"end":380.64,"textEn":"Of days that you''ve used the product consecutively.","words":[{"word":"of","start":378.0,"end":378.22},{"word":"days","start":378.22,"end":378.52},{"word":"that","start":378.52,"end":378.78},{"word":"you''ve","start":378.78,"end":379.08},{"word":"used","start":379.08,"end":379.32},{"word":"the","start":379.32,"end":379.48},{"word":"product","start":379.48,"end":379.82},{"word":"consecutively.","start":379.82,"end":380.64}],"textKo":"사람들은 스트릭을 잃고 싶지 않기 때문이에요. 효과가 있어요.","listenDifficulty":1},{"index":111,"start":381.12,"end":383.4,"textEn":"You just take that number, you put it very prominently","words":[{"word":"You","start":381.12,"end":381.52},{"word":"just","start":381.52,"end":381.68},{"word":"take","start":381.68,"end":381.86},{"word":"that","start":381.86,"end":382.0},{"word":"number,","start":382.0,"end":382.26},{"word":"you","start":382.36,"end":382.42},{"word":"put","start":382.42,"end":382.56},{"word":"it","start":382.56,"end":382.64},{"word":"very","start":382.64,"end":382.86},{"word":"prominently","start":382.86,"end":383.4}],"textKo":"한편으로는, 스트릭이 비판을 받기도 했어요,","listenDifficulty":2},{"index":112,"start":383.4,"end":386.42,"textEn":"In your product, and then people come back every day.","words":[{"word":"in","start":383.4,"end":383.54},{"word":"your","start":383.54,"end":383.66},{"word":"product,","start":383.66,"end":383.98},{"word":"and","start":384.18,"end":384.56},{"word":"then","start":384.56,"end":384.68},{"word":"people","start":384.68,"end":385.08},{"word":"come","start":385.08,"end":385.68},{"word":"back","start":385.68,"end":385.9},{"word":"every","start":385.9,"end":386.2},{"word":"day.","start":386.2,"end":386.42}],"textKo":"예를 들어 십대들을 스냅챗에 중독시킨다고요.","listenDifficulty":1},{"index":113,"start":386.82,"end":390.52,"textEn":"And the reason people come back every day is because, well,","words":[{"word":"And","start":386.82,"end":387.2},{"word":"the","start":387.2,"