":"알림으로 스팸을 보내면 안 돼요.","listenDifficulty":1},{"index":138,"start":473.22,"end":475.94,"textEn":"Even after all this sophistication, it turns out","words":[{"word":"even","start":473.22,"end":473.4},{"word":"after","start":473.4,"end":473.58},{"word":"all","start":473.58,"end":473.74},{"word":"this","start":473.74,"end":473.86},{"word":"sophistication,","start":473.86,"end":474.58},{"word":"it","start":475.28,"end":475.68},{"word":"turns","start":475.68,"end":475.82},{"word":"out","start":475.82,"end":475.94}],"textKo":"우리는 스팸을 보내지 않아요. 듀오링고에서는 실제로","listenDifficulty":1},{"index":139,"start":475.94,"end":478.36,"textEn":"That the algorithm for choosing what time to send you a notification","words":[{"word":"that","start":475.94,"end":476.06},{"word":"the","start":476.06,"end":476.16},{"word":"algorithm","start":476.16,"end":476.5},{"word":"for","start":476.5,"end":476.7},{"word":"choosing","start":476.7,"end":476.92},{"word":"what","start":476.92,"end":477.22},{"word":"time","start":477.22,"end":477.48},{"word":"to","start":477.48,"end":477.62},{"word":"send","start":477.62,"end":477.8},{"word":"you","start":477.8,"end":477.9},{"word":"a","start":477.9,"end":477.98},{"word":"notification","start":477.98,"end":478.36}],"textKo":"7일간 비활성 상태 후에는 알림 보내기를 멈춰요.","listenDifficulty":3},{"index":140,"start":478.36,"end":480.42,"textEn":"Is pretty simple. Do you know","words":[{"word":"is","start":478.36,"end":479.02},{"word":"pretty","start":479.02,"end":479.2},{"word":"simple.","start":479.2,"end":479.5},{"word":"Do","start":479.98,"end":480.3},{"word":"you","start":480.3,"end":480.34},{"word":"know","start":480.34,"end":480.42}],"textKo":"7일 동안 듀오링고를 사용하지 않으면 알림을 중단해요.","listenDifficulty":1},{"index":141,"start":480.42,"end":483.18,"textEn":"What is the best time to send people a notification? I''ll tell you.","words":[{"word":"what","start":480.42,"end":480.6},{"word":"is","start":480.6,"end":480.76},{"word":"the","start":480.76,"end":480.86},{"word":"best","start":480.86,