o learn a language. Now, Duolingo","words":[{"word":"to","start":578.9,"end":579.04},{"word":"get","start":579.04,"end":579.12},{"word":"you","start":579.12,"end":579.22},{"word":"to","start":579.22,"end":579.32},{"word":"learn","start":579.32,"end":579.4},{"word":"a","start":579.4,"end":579.5},{"word":"language.","start":579.5,"end":579.72},{"word":"Now,","start":580.28,"end":580.72},{"word":"Duolingo","start":581.46,"end":581.7}],"textKo":"결국 사람들에게 뭔가를 가르쳐야 하니까요,","listenDifficulty":1},{"index":171,"start":581.7,"end":584.58,"textEn":"Has entered the zeitgeist, and there''s thousands of memes,","words":[{"word":"has","start":581.7,"end":581.86},{"word":"entered","start":581.86,"end":582.04},{"word":"the","start":582.04,"end":582.2},{"word":"zeitgeist,","start":582.2,"end":582.7},{"word":"and","start":582.88,"end":583.32},{"word":"there''s","start":583.32,"end":583.56},{"word":"thousands","start":583.56,"end":584.04},{"word":"of","start":584.04,"end":584.26},{"word":"memes,","start":584.26,"end":584.58}],"textKo":"고양이와 유명인과 경쟁하기는 어렵거든요.","listenDifficulty":1},{"index":172,"start":584.78,"end":586.86,"textEn":"There''s SNL skits about it, and it''s because","words":[{"word":"there''s","start":584.78,"end":584.94},{"word":"SNL","start":584.94,"end":585.3},{"word":"skits","start":585.3,"end":585.6},{"word":"about","start":585.6,"end":585.84},{"word":"it,","start":585.84,"end":586.04},{"word":"and","start":586.24,"end":586.5},{"word":"it''s","start":586.5,"end":586.62},{"word":"because","start":586.62,"end":586.86}],"textKo":"하지만 좋은 소식은 그럴 필요가 없다는 거예요.","listenDifficulty":2},{"index":173,"start":586.86,"end":589.64,"textEn":"We''ve managed to get people","words":[{"word":"we''ve","start":586.86,"end":587.38},{"word":"managed","start":587.38,"end":587.8},{"word":"to","start":588.54,"end":588.98},{"word":"get","start":588.98,"end":589.42},{"word":"people","start":589.42,"end":589.64}],"textKo":"이게 핵심이에요. 뭔가를 배우면 의미를 얻을 수 있어요.","listenDifficulty":1},{"index":174,"start":589.64,"end":592.04,"textEn":"To want to learn a language by using the same techniques","words":[{"word":"to","start":589.64,"end":589.78},{"word":"want","start":589.78,"end":590.12},{"word":"to","start":590.12,"end":590.3},{"word":"learn","start":590.3,"end":590.46},{"word":"a","start":590.46,"end":590.56},{"word":"language","start":590.56,"end":590.8},{"word":"by","start":590.8,"end":590.98},{"word":"using","start":590.98,"end":591.18},{"word":"the","start":591.18,"end":591.32},{"word":"same","start":591.32,"end":591.5},{"word":"techniques","start":591.5,"end":592.04}],"textKo":"반면에 인스타그램을 두 시간 동안 스크롤하면,","listenDifficulty":3},{"index":175,"start":592.04,"end":594.28,"textEn":"That mobile games","words":[{"word":"that","start":592.04,"end":592.78},{"word":"mobile","start":592.78,"end":594.04},{"word":"games","start":594.04,"end":594.28}],"textKo":"많은 경우 나중에 시간을 낭비했다는 느낌이 들어요.","listenDifficulty":1},{"index":176,"start":594.28,"end":596.86,"textEn":"And social media use to get people engaged.","words":[{"word":"and","start":594.28,"end":594.44},{"word":"social","start":594.44,"end":594.68},{"word":"media","start":594.68,"end":594.94},{"word":"use","start":594.94,"end":595.24},{"word":"to","start":595.24,"end":595.86},{"word":"get","start":595.86,"end":596.26},{"word":"people","start":596.26,"end":596.46},{"word":"engaged.","start":596.46,"end":596.86}],"textKo":"그래서 교육 제품이 틱톡의","listenDifficulty":1},{"index":177,"start":598.56,"end":601.0,"textEn":"And this is a really important point, let me say this.","words":[{"word":"And","start":598.56,"end":599.0},{"word":"this","start":599.0,"end":599.44},{"word":"is","start":599.44,"end":599.52},{"word":"a","start":599.52,"end":599.62},{"word":"really","start":599.62,"end":599.78},{"word":"important","start":599.78,"end":600.08},{"word":"point,","start":600.08,"end":600.34},{"word":"let","start":600.42,"end":600.52},{"word":"me","start":600.52,"end":600.62},{"word":"say","start":600.62,"end":600.78},{"word":"this.","start":600.78,"end":601.0}],"textKo":"80~90%만 몰입하게 해도 괜찮다고 생각해요.","listenDifficulty":2},{"index":178,"start":601.96,"end":604.04,"textEn":"I don''t actually believe that there''s a way","words":[{"word":"I","start":601.96,"end":602.4},{"word":"don''t","start":602.4,"end":602.6},{"word":"actually","start":602.6,"end":602.94},{"word":"believe","start":602.94,"end":603.3},{"word":"that","start":603.3,"end":603.48},{"word":"there''s","start":603.48,"end":603.68},{"word":"a","start":603.68,"end":603.78},{"word":"way","start":603.78,"end":604.04}],"textKo":"나머지 10~20%는 사람들의 내적 동기가 채워줄 거니까요,","listenDifficulty":3},{"index":179,"start":604.04,"end":606.52,"textEn":"To make an educational app be as engaging","words":[{"word":"to","start":604.04,"end":604.24},{"word":"make","start":604.24,"end":604.46},{"word":"an","start":604.46,"end":604.78},{"word":"educational","start":604.78,"end":605.32},{"word":"app","start":605.32,"end":605.72},{"word":"be","start":605.72,"end":605.98},{"word":"as","start":605.98,"end":606.1},{"word":"engaging","start":606.1,"end":606.52}],"textKo":"물론 그것보다 훨씬 더 많이는 안 되겠지만요. 이게 정말 핵심이에요.","listenDifficulty":1},{"index":180,"start":606.52,"end":608.84,"textEn":"As something like TikTok or Instagram","words":[{"word":"as","start":606.52,"end":606.86},{"word":"something","start":606.86,"end":607.14},{"word":"like","start":607.14,"end":607.44},{"word":"TikTok","start":607.44,"end":608.2},{"word":"or","start":608.2,"end":608.5},{"word":"Instagram","start":608.5,"end":608.84}],"textKo":"사람들이 의미 있는 일을 하게 하고 싶다면,","listenDifficulty":1},{"index":181,"start":608.84,"end":611.88,"textEn":"Or mobile games. But the good news is that,","words":[{"word":"or","start":608.84,"end":609.3},{"word":"mobile","start":609.3,"end":609.52},{"word":"games.","start":609.52,"end":609.8},{"word":"But","start":610.78,"end":611.18},{"word":"the","start":611.18,"end":611.28},{"word":"good","start":611.28,"end":611.42},{"word":"news","start":611.42,"end":611.58},{"word":"is","start":611.58,"end":611.72},{"word":"that,","start":611.72,"end":611.88}],"textKo":"소셜 미디어 같은 앱이 사용하는 같은 기법을 쓸 수 있어요.","listenDifficulty":1},{"index":182,"start":612.1,"end":614.14,"textEn":"And by the way, the reason I don''t believe that","words":[{"word":"and","start":612.1,"end":612.66},{"word":"by","start":612.66,"end":612.76},{"word":"the","start":612.76,"end":612.84},{"word":"way,","start":612.84,"end":612.92},{"word":"the","start":613.02,"end":613.3},{"word":"reason","start":613.3,"end":613.5},{"word":"I","start":613.5,"end":613.62},{"word":"don''t","start":613.62,"end":613.74},{"word":"believe","start":613.74,"end":613.94},{"word":"that","start":613.94,"end":614.14}],"textKo":"그 앱들만큼 몰입하게 하지 못하더라도,","listenDifficulty":3},{"index":183,"start":614.14,"end":616.34,"textEn":"Is because ultimately you have to teach people something,","words":[{"word":"is","start":614.14,"end":614.4},{"word":"because","start":614.4,"end":614.56},{"word":"ultimately","start":614.56,"end":614.9},{"word":"you","start":614.9,"end":615.08},{"word":"have","start":615.08,"end":615.22},{"word":"to","start":615.22,"end":615.34},{"word":"teach","start":615.34,"end":615.8},{"word":"people","start":615.8,"end":616.04},{"word":"something,","start":616.04,"end":616.34}],"textKo":"수억 명의 사람들이 여러분의 제품을 사용하게 할 수 있어요.","listenDifficulty":2},{"index":184,"start":616.48,"end":618.6,"textEn":"And it''s hard to compete with cats and celebrities.","words":[{"word":"and","start":616.48,"end":616.68},{"word":"it''s","start":616.68,"end":616.8},{"word":"hard","start":616.8,"end":616.94},{"word":"to","start":616.94,"end":617.08},{"word":"compete","start":617.08,"end":617.4},{"word":"with","start":617.4,"end":617.62},{"word":"cats","start":617.62,"end":618.06},{"word":"and","start":618.06,"end":618.22},{"word":"celebrities.","start":618.22,"end":618.6}],"textKo":"듀오링고의 경우,","listenDifficulty":2},{"index":185,"start":619.7,"end":622.1,"textEn":"But the good news is that I don''t think you have to.","words":[{"word":"But","start":619.7,"end":620.1},{"word":"the","start":620.1,"end":620.5},{"word":"good","start":620.5,"end":620.68},{"word":"news","start":620.68,"end":620.84},{"word":"is","start":620.84,"end":620.96},{"word":"that","start":620.96,"end":621.06},{"word":"I","start":621.06,"end":621.2},{"word":"don''t","start":621.2,"end":621.34},{"word":"think","start":621.34,"end":621.46},{"word":"you","start":621.46,"end":621.6},{"word":"have","start":621.6,"end":621.88},{"word":"to.","start":621.88,"end":622.1}],"textKo":"예를 들어 미국에서 듀오링고로 언어를 배우는 사람이","listenDifficulty":3},{"index":186,"start":622.62,"end":625.78,"textEn":"See, here''s the thing. When you''re learning something, you get meaning out of it.","words":[{"word":"See,","start":622.62,"end":622.86},{"word":"here''s","start":622.92,"end":623.08},{"word":"the","start":623.08,"end":623.18},{"word":"thing.","start":623.18,"end":623.32},{"word":"When","start":623.48,"end":623.7},{"word":"you''re","start":623.7,"end":623.88},{"word":"learning","start":623.88,"end":624.2},{"word":"something,","start":624.2,"end":624.52},{"word":"you","start":624.64,"end":624.74},{"word":"get","start":624.74,"end":624.86},{"word":"meaning","start":624.86,"end":625.26},{"word":"out","start":625.26,"end":625.48},{"word":"of","start":625.48,"end":625.58},{"word":"it.","start":625.58,"end":625.78}],"textKo":"미국 전체 고등학교에서 언어를 배우는 사람보다 더 많아요.","listenDifficulty":2},{"index":187,"start":626.34,"end":628.64,"textEn":"Whereas when you''re scrolling for two hours on Instagram,","words":[{"word":"Whereas","start":626.34,"end":626.74},{"word":"when","start":626.74,"end":627.04},{"word":"you''re","start":627.04,"end":627.28},{"word":"scrolling","start":627.28,"end":627.74},{"word":"for","start":627.74,"end":627.92},{"word":"two","start":627.92,"end":628.06},{"word":"hours","start":628.06,"end":628.22},{"word":"on","start":628.22,"end":628.34},{"word":"Instagram,","start":628.34,"end":628.64}],"textKo":"이건 전 세계 대부분의 나라에서도 마찬가지예요. 제 희망은,","listenDifficulty":2},{"index":188,"start":629.06,"end":631.88,"textEn":"A lot of times afterwards, you feel like you just wasted your time.","words":[{"word":"a","start":629.06,"end":629.22},{"word":"lot","start":629.22,"end":629.3},{"word":"of","start":629.3,"end":629.4},{"word":"times","start":629.4,"end":629.64},{"word":"afterwards,","start":629.64,"end":630.04},{"word":"you","start":630.58,"end":630.78},{"word":"feel","start":630.78,"end":630.92},{"word":"like","start":630.92,"end":631.04},{"word":"you","start":631.04,"end":631.14},{"word":"just","start":631.14,"end":631.28},{"word":"wasted","start":631.28,"end":631.52},{"word":"your","start":631.52,"end":631.66},{"word":"time.","start":631.66,"end":631.88}],"textKo":"우리가 할 수 있다는 건 알지만, 제 희망은","listenDifficulty":3},{"index":189,"start":631.88,"end":634.06,"textEn":"So I think it''s actually okay","words":[{"word":"So","start":631.88,"end":632.72},{"word":"I","start":632.72,"end":633.0},{"word":"think","start":633.0,"end":633.14},{"word":"it''s","start":633.14,"end":633.32},{"word":"actually","start":633.32,"end":633.56},{"word":"okay","start":633.56,"end":634.06}],"textKo":"인류로서, 듀오링고가 언어 학습에서 한 것을","listenDifficulty":1},{"index":190,"start":634.64,"end":637.82,"textEn":"If your educational product is only 80 or 90%","words":[{"word":"if","start":634.64,"end":635.12},{"word":"your","start":635.12,"end":635.48},{"word":"educational","start":635.48,"end":636.0},{"word":"product","start":636.0,"end":636.44},{"word":"is","start":636.44,"end":636.88},{"word":"only","start":636.88,"end":637.06},{"word":"80","start":637.06,"end":637.26},{"word":"or","start":637.26,"end":637.38},{"word":"90","start":637.38,"end":637.58},{"word":"%","start":637.58,"end":637.82}],"textKo":"다른 모든 과목에서도 할 수 있으면 좋겠어요. 수백만 명이","listenDifficulty":1},{"index":191,"start":637.82,"end":641.52,"textEn":"As engaging as something like TikTok, because the other 10 or 20%","words":[{"word":"as","start":637.82,"end":638.0},{"word":"engaging","start":638.0,"end":638.3},{"word":"as","start":638.3,"end":638.44},{"word":"something","start":638.44,"end":638.6},{"word":"like","start":638.6,"end":638.78},{"word":"TikTok,","start":638.78,"end":639.08},{"word":"because","start":639.58,"end":640.06},{"word":"the","start":640.06,"end":640.44},{"word":"other","start":640.44,"end":640.6},{"word":"10","start":640.6,"end":640.88},{"word":"or","start":640.88,"end":641.0},{"word":"20","start":641.0,"end":641.24},{"word":"%","start":641.24,"end":641.52}],"textKo":"휴대폰으로 수학을 배우거나,","listenDifficulty":2},{"index":192,"start":641.52,"end":643.56,"textEn":"Will be provided by people''s internal motivation,","words":[{"word":"will","start":641.52,"end":641.86},{"word":"be","start":641.86,"end":641.96},{"word":"provided","start":641.96,"end":642.32},{"word":"by","start":642.32,"end":642.48},{"word":"people''s","start":642.48,"end":642.76},{"word":"internal","start":642.76,"end":643.06},{"word":"motivation,","start":643.06,"end":643.56}],"textKo":"수백만 명이 휴대폰으로 수학이나 물리학이나 뭐든 배우는 거요.","listenDifficulty":2},{"index":193,"start":643.9,"end":647.08,"textEn":"Though, of course, not much more than that. This is really a key point.","words":[{"word":"though,","start":643.9,"end":644.02},{"word":"of","start":644.12,"end":644.2},{"word":"course,","start":644.2,"end":644.38},{"word":"not","start":644.56,"end":644.8},{"word":"much","start":644.8,"end":645.0},{"word":"more","start":645.0,"end":645.16},{"word":"than","start":645.16,"end":645.28},{"word":"that.","start":645.28,"end":645.54},{"word":"This","start":645.82,"end":646.3},{"word":"is","start":646.3,"end":646.42},{"word":"really","start":646.42,"end":646.6},{"word":"a","start":646.6,"end":646.72},{"word":"key","start":646.72,"end":646.84},{"word":"point.","start":646.84,"end":647.08}],"textKo":"스크린 타임이 나쁜 것이 아닌 미래를 희망해요.","listenDifficulty":3},{"index":194,"start":647.44,"end":650.64,"textEn":"If you want to get people to do something meaningful,","words":[{"word":"If","start":647.44,"end":647.72},{"word":"you","start":647.72,"end":647.88},{"word":"want","start":647.88,"end":648.1},{"word":"to","start":648.1,"end":648.2},{"word":"get","start":648.2,"end":648.34},{"word":"people","start":648.34,"end":648.58},{"word":"to","start":648.58,"end":648.72},{"word":"do","start":648.72,"end":648.82},{"word":"something","start":648.82,"end":649.2},{"word":"meaningful,","start":649.2,"end":650.64}],"textKo":"고품질 교육을 모든 사람에게, 부자든 가난한 사람이든,","listenDifficulty":1},{"index":195,"start":650.96,"end":654.34,"textEn":"You can use the same techniques that apps like social media use","words":[{"word":"you","start":650.96,"end":651.2},{"word":"can","start":651.2,"end":651.3},{"word":"use","start":651.3,"end":651.48},{"word":"the","start":651.48,"end":651.6},{"word":"same","start":651.6,"end":651.76},{"word":"techniques","start":651.76,"end":652.2},{"word":"that","start":652.2,"end":652.52},{"word":"apps","start":652.52,"end":652.9},{"word":"like","start":652.9,"end":653.18},{"word":"social","start":653.18,"end":653.74},{"word":"media","start":653.74,"end":654.0},{"word":"use","start":654.0,"end":654.34}],"textKo":"휴대폰을 사용해서 전달할 수 있는 미래요.","listenDifficulty":2},{"index":196,"start":654.34,"end":657.14,"textEn":"To get people to do it. And even if you''re not","words":[{"word":"to","start":654.34,"end":654.8},{"word":"get","start":654.8,"end":654.92},{"word":"people","start":654.92,"end":655.14},{"word":"to","start":655.14,"end":655.28},{"word":"do","start":655.28,"end":655.42},{"word":"it.","start":655.42,"end":655.58},{"word":"And","start":655.96,"end":656.42},{"word":"even","start":656.42,"end":656.64},{"word":"if","start":656.64,"end":656.76},{"word":"you''re","start":656.76,"end":656.9},{"word":"not","start":656.9,"end":657.14}],"textKo":"하지만 이 강연을 마무리하면서 가장 중요한 한 가지는","listenDifficulty":2},{"index":197,"start":657.14,"end":660.28,"textEn":"As engaging as those apps are, you can still get hundreds","words":[{"word":"as","start":657.14,"end":657.44},{"word":"engaging","start":657.44,"end":657.96},{"word":"as","start":657.96,"end":658.2},{"word":"those","start":658.2,"end":658.38},{"word":"apps","start":658.38,"end":658.62},{"word":"are,","start":658.62,"end":658.84},{"word":"you","start":658.84,"end":659.4},{"word":"can","start":659.4,"end":659.52},{"word":"still","start":659.52,"end":659.74},{"word":"get","start":659.74,"end":659.94},{"word":"hundreds","start":659.94,"end":660.28}],"textKo":"부디, 제발요,","listenDifficulty":2},{"index":198,"start":660.28,"end":663.56,"textEn":"Of millions of people to use your product. In the case of Duolingo,","words":[{"word":"of","start":660.28,"end":660.5},{"word":"millions","start":660.5,"end":660.74},{"word":"of","start":660.74,"end":660.94},{"word":"people","start":660.94,"end":661.18},{"word":"to","start":661.18,"end":661.36},{"word":"use","start":661.36,"end":661.54},{"word":"your","start":661.54,"end":661.66},{"word":"product.","start":661.66,"end":661.98},{"word":"In","start":662.5,"end":662.92},{"word":"the","start":662.92,"end":662.98},{"word":"case","start":662.98,"end":663.1},{"word":"of","start":663.1,"end":663.22},{"word":"Duolingo,","start":663.22,"end":663.56}],"textKo":"제발 부탁드려요, 오늘 언어 수업을 해주세요.","listenDifficulty":2},{"index":199,"start":663.64,"end":665.72,"textEn":"For example, there are more people","words":[{"word":"for","start":663.64,"end":663.74},{"word":"example,","start":663.74,"end":664.06},{"word":"there","start":664.8,"end":665.22},{"word":"are","start":665.22,"end":665.32},{"word":"more","start":665.32,"end":665.48},{"word":"people","start":665.48,"end":665.72}],"textKo":"정말 감사합니다. 감사합니다. 감사합니다.","listenDifficulty":1},{"index":200,"start":665.72,"end":667.98,"textEn":"Learning languages on Duolingo in the United States","words":[{"word":"learning","start":665.72,"end":665.98},{"word":"languages","start":665.98,"end":666.3},{"word":"on","start":666.3,"end":666.48},{"word":"Duolingo","start":666.48,"end":666.84},{"word":"in","start":666.84,"end":667.32},{"word":"the","start":667.32,"end":667.4},{"