hin","start":78.78,"end":79.08},{"word":"these","start":79.08,"end":79.32},{"word":"nine","start":79.32,"end":79.56},{"word":"dots","start":79.56,"end":79.96},{"word":"without","start":79.96,"end":81.24},{"word":"lifting","start":81.24,"end":81.64},{"word":"the","start":81.64,"end":81.82},{"word":"pencil.","start":81.82,"end":82.14},{"word":"The","start":82.54,"end":83.1},{"word":"only","start":83.1,"end":83.3},{"word":"way","start":83.3,"end":83.48}],"textKo":"연필을 떼지 않고 아홉 개의 점 안에서 다섯 개의 선을 그어야 해요. 그것을 하는 유일한 방법은","listenDifficulty":1},{"index":10,"start":83.48,"end":93.92,"textEn":"To do it was to go outside the box. Don''t be afraid to think outside the box. Don''t be afraid to fail big,","words":[{"word":"to","start":83.48,"end":83.62},{"word":"do","start":83.62,"end":83.76},{"word":"it","start":83.76,"end":83.9},{"word":"was","start":83.9,"end":84.06},{"word":"to","start":84.06,"end":84.18},{"word":"go","start":84.18,"end":84.34},{"word":"outside","start":84.34,"end":84.76},{"word":"the","start":84.76,"end":85.06},{"word":"box.","start":85.06,"end":85.48},{"word":"Don''t","start":87.76,"end":88.36},{"word":"be","start":88.36,"end":88.48},{"word":"afraid","start":88.48,"end":88.86},{"word":"to","start":88.86,"end":89.18},{"word":"think","start":89.18,"end":90.38},{"word":"outside","start":90.38,"end":91.08},{"word":"the","start":91.08,"end":91.44},{"word":"box.","start":91.44,"end":91.7},{"word":"Don''t","start":91.82,"end":91.92},{"word":"be","start":91.92,"end":92.02},{"word":"afraid","start":92.02,"end":92.38},{"word":"to","start":92.38,"end":92.66},{"word":"fail","start":92.66,"end":93.14},{"word":"big,","start":93.14,"end":93.92}],"textKo":"틀 밖으로 나가는 거예요. 틀 밖에서 생각하는 것을 두려워하지 마세요. 크게 실패하는 것을 두려워하지 마세요.","listenDifficulty":1},{"index":11,"start":93.92,"end":104.38,"textEn":"To dream big. But remember, dreams without goals are just dreams.","words":[{"word":"to","start":93.92,"end":94.72},{"word":"dream","start":94.72,"end":95.18},{"word":"big.","start":95.18,"end":96.46},{"word":"But","start":97.0,"end":97.02},{"word":"remember,","start":97.02,"end":97.56},{"word":"dreams","start":97.84,"end":99.82},{"word":"without","start":99.82,"end":101.14},{"word":"goals","start":101.14,"end":101.84},{"word":"are","start":101.84,"end":103.66},{"word":"just","start":103.66,"end":103.88},{"word":"dreams.","start":103.88,"end":104.38}],"textKo":"크게 꿈꾸세요. 하지만 기억하세요, 목표 없는 꿈은 그냥 꿈일 뿐이에요.","listenDifficulty":1},{"index":12,"start":108.48,"end":115.02,"textEn":"Reggie Jackson struck out 2,600 times in his career, the most in the history of baseball. But you don''t","words":[{"word":"Reggie","start":108.48,"end":109.18},{"word":"Jackson","start":109.18,"end":109.52},{"word":"struck","start":109.52,"end":109.8},{"word":"out","start":109.8,"end":110.0},{"word":"2","start":110.0,"end":110.24},{"word":",600","start":110.24,"end":110.64},{"word":"times","start":110.64,"end":111.16},{"word":"in","start":111.16,"end":111.34},{"word":"his","start":111.34,"end":111.48},{"word":"career,","start":111.48,"end":111.78},{"word":"the","start":111.9,"end":111.96},{"word":"most","start":111.96,"end":112.3},{"word":"in","start":112.3,"end":113.02},{"word":"the","start":113.02,"end":113.12},{"word":"history","start":113.12,"end":113.48},{"word":"of","start":113.48,"end":113.68},{"word":"baseball.","start":113.68,"end":114.18},{"word":"But","start":114.46,"end":114.7},{"word":"you","start":114.7,"end":114.82},{"word":"don''t","start":114.82,"end":115.02}],"textKo":"레지 잭슨은 선수 생활에서 2,600번 삼진을 당했어요. 야구 역사상 가장 많은 횟수예요. 하지만 여러분은","listenDifficulty":2},{"index":13,"start":115.02,"end":123.9,"textEn":"Hear about the strikeouts. People remember the home runs. Fall forward. Thomas Edison conducted one","words":[{"word":"hear","start":115.02,"end":115.18},{"word":"about","start":115.18,"end":115.4},{"word":"the","start":115.4,"end":115.54},{"word":"strikeouts.","start":115.54,"end":116.1},{"word":"People","start":116.32,"end":116.58},{"word":"remember","start":116.58,"