oy, I have a prophecy, a spiritual prophecy. She said, you are going to travel the world","words":[{"word":"She","start":502.02,"end":502.58},{"word":"said,","start":502.58,"end":502.76},{"word":"young","start":502.88,"end":502.98},{"word":"boy,","start":502.98,"end":503.32},{"word":"I","start":503.74,"end":504.28},{"word":"have","start":504.28,"end":504.46},{"word":"a","start":504.46,"end":504.56},{"word":"prophecy,","start":504.56,"end":505.06},{"word":"a","start":505.66,"end":506.24},{"word":"spiritual","start":506.24,"end":506.74},{"word":"prophecy.","start":506.74,"end":507.36},{"word":"She","start":508.96,"end":509.52},{"word":"said,","start":509.52,"end":509.74},{"word":"you","start":509.92,"end":509.98},{"word":"are","start":509.98,"end":510.18},{"word":"going","start":510.18,"end":510.46},{"word":"to","start":510.46,"end":510.66},{"word":"travel","start":510.66,"end":511.08},{"word":"the","start":511.08,"end":511.36},{"word":"world","start":511.36,"end":511.84}],"textKo":"이렇게 말씀하셨어요, 젊은이, 나에게 예언이 있어요, 영적인 예언이요. 너는 세계를 여행하며","listenDifficulty":2},{"index":65,"start":512.46,"end":520.1,"textEn":"And speak to millions of people. And in the years that follow, just as that woman prophesies,","words":[{"word":"and","start":512.34,"end":512.62},{"word":"speak","start":512.62,"end":513.04},{"word":"to","start":513.04,"end":513.5},{"word":"millions","start":513.5,"end":513.96},{"word":"of","start":513.96,"end":514.24},{"word":"people.","start":514.24,"end":514.58},{"word":"And","start":516.96,"end":517.52},{"word":"in","start":517.52,"end":517.64},{"word":"the","start":517.64,"end":517.72},{"word":"years","start":517.72,"end":517.98},{"word":"that","start":517.98,"end":518.16},{"word":"follow,","start":518.16,"end":518.52},{"word":"just","start":518.62,"end":518.78},{"word":"as","start":518.78,"end":518.96},{"word":"that","start":518.96,"end":519.12},{"word":"woman","start":519.12,"end":519.36},{"word":"prophesies,","start":519.36,"end":520.1}],"textKo":"수백만 명의 사람들에