:123.66},{"word":"-term","start":123.66,"end":123.96},{"word":"memories","start":123.96,"end":124.4},{"word":"for","start":124.4,"end":124.64},{"word":"facts","start":124.64,"end":125.02},{"word":"and","start":125.02,"end":125.18},{"word":"events.","start":125.18,"end":125.46}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":30,"start":125.6,"end":128.44,"textEn":"And that structure is called the hippocampus.","textKo":"그 구조를 해마라고 합니다.","words":[{"word":"And","start":125.6,"end":125.88},{"word":"that","start":125.88,"end":126.12},{"word":"structure","start":126.12,"end":126.54},{"word":"is","start":126.54,"end":126.88},{"word":"called","start":126.88,"end":127.32},{"word":"the","start":127.32,"end":127.74},{"word":"hippocampus.","start":127.74,"end":128.44}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":31,"start":128.66,"end":132.08,"textEn":"So I have always been fascinated with the hippocampus.","textKo":"저는 항상 해마에 매료되어 왔습니다.","words":[{"word":"So","start":128.66,"end":129.0},{"word":"I","start":129.0,"end":129.38},{"word":"have","start":129.38,"end":129.54},{"word":"always","start":129.54,"end":129.86},{"word":"been","start":129.86,"end":130.06},{"word":"fascinated","start":130.06,"end":130.68},{"word":"with","start":130.68,"end":131.2},{"word":"the","start":131.2,"end":131.36},{"word":"hippocampus.","start":131.36,"end":132.08}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":32,"start":132.32,"end":136.92,"textEn":"How could it be that an event that lasts just a moment,","textKo":"단 한 순간만 지속되는 사건이 어떻게","words":[{"word":"How","start":132.32,"end":132.9},{"word":"could","start":132.9,"end":133.12},{"word":"it","start":133.12,"end":133.24},{"word":"be","start":133.24,"end":133.64},{"word":"that","start":133.64,"end":134.3},{"word":"an","start":134.3,"end":135.1},{"word":"event","start":135.1,"end":135.42},{"word":"that","start":135.42,"end":135.64},{"word":"lasts","start":135.64,"end":136.12},{"word":"just","start":136.12,"end":136.4},{"word":"a","start":136.4,"end":136.58},{"word":"moment,","start":136.58,"end":136.92}],"listenDifficulty":3},{"index":33,"start":137.26,"end":142.52,"textEn":"Say, your first kiss, or the moment your first child was born,","textKo":"예를 들어 첫 키스라든가, 첫 아이가 태어난 순간이","words":[{"word":"say,","start":137.26,"end":137.82},{"word":"your","start":138.08,"end":138.42},{"word":"first","start":138.42,"end":138.68},{"word":"kiss,","start":138.68,"end":139.1},{"word":"or","start":139.36,"end":139.84},{"word":"the","start":139.84,"end":139.98},{"word":"moment","start":139.98,"end":140.3},{"word":"your","start":140.3,"end":140.54},{"word":"first","start":140.54,"end":140.8},{"word":"child","start":140.8,"end":141.28},{"word":"was","start":141.28,"end":142.12},{"word":"born,","start":142.12,"end":142.52}],"listenDifficulty":1},{"index":34,"start":142.72,"end":145.92,"textEn":"Can form a memory that has changed your brain","textKo":"여러분의 뇌를 변화시키는 기억을 형성할 수 있을까요?","words":[{"word":"can","start":142.72,"end":143.4},{"word":"form","start":143.4,"end":143.92},{"word":"a","start":143.92,"end":144.14},{"word":"memory","start":144.14,"end":144.46},{"word":"that","start":144.46,"end":144.66},{"word":"has","start":144.66,"end":144.82},{"word":"changed","start":144.82,"end":145.28},{"word":"your","start":145.28,"end":145.48},{"word":"brain","start":145.48,"end":145.92}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":35,"start":145.92,"end":148.08,"textEn":"That lasts an entire lifetime?","textKo":"평생 지속되는 기억을요.","words":[{"word":"that","start":145.92,"end":146.42},{"word":"lasts","start":146.42,"end":146.98},{"word":"an","start":146.98,"end":147.18},{"word":"entire","start":147.18,"end":147.52},{"word":"lifetime?","start":147.52,"end":148.08}],"listenDifficulty":1},{"index":36,"start":148.48,"end":153.92,"textEn":"That''s what I want to understand. I wanted to start and record the activity","textKo":"그것이 제가 이해하고 싶었던 것입니다. 저는 활동을 기록하기 시작하고 싶었습니다.","words":[{"word":"That''s","start":148.48,"end":148.94},{"word":"what","start":148.94,"end":149.06},{"word":"I","start":149.06,"end":149.16},{"word":"want","start":149.16,"end":149.28},{"word":"to","start":149.28,"end":149.4},{"word":"understand.","start":149.4,"end":149.92},{"word":"I","start":150.44,"end":150.98},{"word":"wanted","start":150.98,"end":151.54},{"word":"to","start":151.54,"end":151.76},{"word":"start","start":151.76,"end":152.26},{"word":"and","start":152.26,"end":152.64},{"word":"record","start":152.64,"end":153.22},{"word":"the","start":153.22,"end":153.46},{"word":"activity","start":153.46,"end":153.92}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":37,"start":153.92,"end":157.24,"textEn":"Of individual brain cells in the hippocampus","textKo":"해마에 있는 개별 뇌세포들의 활동을","words":[{"word":"of","start":153.92,"end":154.14},{"word":"individual","start":154.14,"end":154.7},{"word":"brain","start":154.7,"end":155.08},{"word":"cells","start":155.08,"end":155.5},{"word":"in","start":155.5,"end":156.12},{"word":"the","start":156.12,"end":156.56},{"word":"hippocampus","start":156.56,"end":157.24}],"listenDifficulty":1},{"index":38,"start":157.24,"end":159.48,"textEn":"As subjects were forming new memories,","textKo":"피험자들이 새로운 기억을 형성할 때 말이에요.","words":[{"word":"as","start":157.24,"end":157.68},{"word":"subjects","start":157.68,"end":158.1},{"word":"were","start":158.1,"end":158.32},{"word":"forming","start":158.32,"end":158.74},{"word":"new","start":158.74,"end":159.12},{"word":"memories,","start":159.12,"end":159.48}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":39,"start":159.62,"end":164.78,"textEn":"And essentially try and decode how those brief bursts of electrical activity,","textKo":"그리고 본질적으로 그 짧은 전기 활동의 폭발을 해독하려고 했습니다.","words":[{"word":"and","start":159.62,"end":159.82},{"word":"essentially","start":159.82,"end":160.16},{"word":"try","start":160.16,"end":160.44},{"word":"and","start":160.44,"end":160.58},{"word":"decode","start":160.58,"end":161.28},{"word":"how","start":161.28,"end":161.92},{"word":"those","start":161.92,"end":162.44},{"word":"brief","start":162.44,"end":162.86},{"word":"bursts","start":162.86,"end":