learly,","start":446.52,"end":447.04},{"word":"we","start":447.04,"end":447.26},{"word":"need","start":447.26,"end":447.36},{"word":"to","start":447.36,"end":447.48},{"word":"be","start":447.48,"end":447.6},{"word":"better","start":447.6,"end":447.98},{"word":"at","start":447.98,"end":448.34},{"word":"helping","start":448.34,"end":448.62},{"word":"people","start":448.62,"end":448.98},{"word":"recover","start":448.98,"end":449.54},{"word":"from","start":449.54,"end":449.88},{"word":"stroke.","start":449.88,"end":450.24}],"listenDifficulty":1},{"index":102,"start":450.42,"end":453.58,"textEn":"And this is an enormous societal problem.","textKo":"이것은 엄청난 사회적 문제입니다.","words":[{"word":"And","start":450.42,"end":450.5},{"word":"this","start":450.5,"end":450.76},{"word":"is","start":450.76,"end":450.86},{"word":"an","start":450.86,"end":451.02},{"word":"enormous","start":451.02,"end":451.6},{"word":"societal","start":451.6,"end":452.48},{"word":"problem.","start":452.48,"end":453.58}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":103,"start":453.58,"end":457.64,"textEn":"And it''s one that we''re not solving. So what can be done?","textKo":"그리고 우리가 해결하지 못하고 있는 문제입니다. 그렇다면 무엇을 할 수 있을까요?","words":[{"word":"And","start":453.58,"end":453.9},{"word":"it''s","start":453.9,"end":454.08},{"word":"one","start":454.08,"end":454.26},{"word":"that","start":454.26,"end":454.44},{"word":"we''re","start":454.44,"end":454.74},{"word":"not","start":454.74,"end":454.92},{"word":"solving.","start":454.92,"end":455.4},{"word":"So","start":456.32,"end":456.96},{"word":"what","start":456.96,"end":457.16},{"word":"can","start":457.16,"end":457.3},{"word":"be","start":457.3,"end":457.42},{"word":"done?","start":457.42,"end":457.64}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":104,"start":458.56,"end":460.62,"textEn":"One thing is absolutely clear.","textKo":"한 가지는 절대적으로 분명합니다.","words":[{"word":"One","start":458.56,"end":459.1},{"word":"thing","start":459.1,"end":459.26},{"word":"is","start":459.26,"end":459.44},{"word":"absolutely","start":459.44,"end":459.98},{"word":"clear.","start":459.98,"end":460.62}],"listenDifficulty":1},{"index":105,"start":460.94,"end":464.94,"textEn":"The best driver of neuroplastic change in your brain is your behavior.","textKo":"뇌의 신경가소적 변화를 이끄는 최고의 동력은 여러분의 행동입니다.","words":[{"word":"The","start":460.94,"end":461.36},{"word":"best","start":461.36,"end":461.68},{"word":"driver","start":461.68,"end":462.02},{"word":"of","start":462.02,"end":462.3},{"word":"neuroplastic","start":462.3,"end":462.88},{"word":"change","start":462.88,"end":463.2},{"word":"in","start":463.2,"end":463.58},{"word":"your","start":463.58,"end":463.8},{"word":"brain","start":463.8,"end":464.18},{"word":"is","start":464.18,"end":464.42},{"word":"your","start":464.42,"end":464.56},{"word":"behavior.","start":464.56,"end":464.94}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":106,"start":466.28,"end":471.4,"textEn":"The problem is that the dose of behavior, the dose of practice that''s required to learn","textKo":"문제는 행동의 양, 새로운 것을 배우고","words":[{"word":"The","start":466.28,"end":466.84},{"word":"problem","start":466.84,"end":467.24},{"word":"is","start":467.24,"end":467.62},{"word":"that","start":467.62,"end":467.84},{"word":"the","start":467.84,"end":467.96},{"word":"dose","start":467.96,"end":468.24},{"word":"of","start":468.24,"end":468.4},{"word":"behavior,","start":468.4,"end":468.84},{"word":"the","start":468.98,"end":469.1},{"word":"dose","start":469.1,"end":469.3},{"word":"of","start":469.3,"end":469.44},{"word":"practice","start":469.44,"end":469.98},{"word":"that''s","start":469.98,"end":470.44},{"word":"required","start":470.44,"end":470.88},{"word":"to","start":470.88,"end":471.12},{"word":"learn","start":471.12,"end":471.4}],"listenDifficulty":3},{"index":107,"start":471.4,"end":474.9,"textEn":"New and relearn old motor skills, it''s very large.","textKo":"오래된 운동 기술을 다시 배우는 데 필요한 연습의 양이 매우 많다는 것입니다.","words":[{"word":"new","start":471.4,"end":471.7},{"word":"and","start":471.7,"end":472.0},{"word":"relearn","start":472.0,"end":472.52},{"word":"old","start":472.52,"end":472.8},{"word":"motor","start":472.8,"end":473.14},{"word":"skills,","start":473.14,"end":473.54},{"word":"it''s","start":473.78,"end":474.24},{"word":"very","start":474.24,"end":474.5},{"word":"large.","start":474.5,"end":474.9}],"listenDifficulty":1},{"index":108,"start":475.24,"end":480.52,"textEn":"And how to effectively deliver these large doses of practice is a very difficult problem.","textKo":"그리고 이 많은 양의 연습을 효과적으로 전달하는 방법은 매우 어려운 문제입니다.","words":[{"word":"And","start":475.24,"end":475.8},{"word":"how","start":475.8,"end":475.94},{"word":"to","start":475.94,"end":476.06},{"word":"effectively","start":476.06,"end":476.62},{"word":"deliver","start":476.62,"end":477.1},{"word":"these","start":477.1,"end":477.38},{"word":"large","start":477.38,"end":477.74},{"word":"doses","start":477.74,"end":478.12},{"word":"of","start":478.12,"end":478.34},{"word":"practice","start":478.34,"end":478.78},{"word":"is","start":478.78,"end":479.38},{"word":"a","start":479.38,"end":479.54},{"word":"very","start":479.54,"end":479.74},{"word":"difficult","start":479.74,"end":480.1},{"word":"problem.","start":480.1,"end":480.52}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":109,"start":480.68,"end":487.74,"textEn":"It''s also a very expensive problem. So the approach that my research has taken is to develop therapies that prime or that prepare","textKo":"또한 매우 비용이 많이 드는 문제입니다. 그래서 제 연구가 취한 접근 방식은 뇌가 학습할 준비를 하도록 프라이밍하거나 준비시키는 치료법을 개발하는 것입니다.","words":[{"word":"It''s","start":480.68,"end":480.78},{"word":"also","start":480.78,"end":480.96},{"word":"a","start":480.96,"end":481.1},{"word":"very","start":481.1,"end":481.26},{"word":"expensive","start":481.26,"end":481.82},{"word":"problem.","start":481.82,"end":482.32},{"word":"So","start":482.76,"end":483.32},{"word":"the","start":483.32,"end":483.4},{"word":"approach","start":483.4,"end":483.64},{"word":"that","start":483.64,"end":483.8},{"word":"my","start":483.8,"end":483.96},{"word":"research","start":483.96,"end":484.26},{"word":"has","start":484.26,"end":484.48},{"word":"taken","start":484.48,"end":484.78},{"word":"is","start":484.78,"end":485.0},{"word":"to","start":485.0,"end":485.14},{"word":"develop","start":485.14,"end":485.48},{"word":"therapies","start":485.48,"end":485.98},{"word":"that","start":485.98,"end":486.24},{"word":"prime","start":486.24,"end":486.76},{"word":"or","start":486.76,"end":487.02},{"word":"that","start":487.02,"end":487.2},{"word":"prepare","start":487.2,"end":487.74}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":110,"start":487.74,"end":493.58,"textEn":"The brain to learn. And these have included brain stimulation, exercise, and robotics.","textKo":"여기에는 뇌 자극, 운동, 로봇공학이 포함됩니다.","words":[{"word":"the","start":487.74,"end":487.94},{"word":"brain","start":487.94,"end":488.2},{"word":"to","start":488.2,"end":488.4},{"word":"learn.","start":488.4,"end":488.68},{"word":"And","start":488.98,"end":489.54},{"word":"these","start":489.54,"end":489.7},{"word":"have","start":489.7,"end":489.82},{"word":"included","start":489.82,"end":490.14},{"word":"brain","start":490.14,"end":490.4},{"word":"stimulation,","start":490.4,"end":491.0},{"word":"exercise,","start":491.58,"end":492.26},{"word":"and","start":492.62,"end":492.88},{"word":"robotics.","start":492.88,"end":493.58}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":111,"start":493.58,"end":499.98,"textEn":"But through my research, I''ve realized that a major limitation to the development of therapies","textKo":"하지만 연구를 통해, 뇌졸중 회복을 가속화하는 치료법 개발의 주요 한계는","words":[{"word":"But","start":493.58,"end":494.72},{"word":"through","start":494.72,"end":495.12},{"word":"my","start":495.12,"end":495.3},{"word":"research,","start":495.3,"end":495.68},{"word":"I''ve","start":495.92,"end":496.32},{"word":"realized","start":496.32,"end":496.58},{"word":"that","start":496.58,"end":496.74},{"word":"a","start":496.74,"end":496.88},{"word":"major","start":496.88,"end":497.22},{"word":"limitation","start":497.22,"end":497.84},{"word":"to","start":497.84,"end":498.3},{"word":"the","start":498.3,"end":498.44},{"word":"development","start":498.44,"end":498.98},{"word":"of","start":498.98,"end":499.56},{"word":"therapies","start":499.56,"end":499.98}],"listenDifficulty":1},{"index":112,"start":499.98,"end":506.4,"textEn":"That speed recovery from stroke is that patterns of neuroplasticity are highly variable from person","textKo":"신경가소성의 패턴이 사람마다 매우 다양하다는 것임을 깨달았습니다.","words":[{"word":"that","start":499.98,"end":500.2},{"word":"speed","start":500.2,"end":500.48},{"word":"recovery","start":500.48,"end":500.96},{"word":"from","start":500.96,"end":501.22},{"word":"stroke","start":501.22,"end":501.62},{"word":"is","start":501.62,"end":501.86},{"word":"that","start":501.86,"end":502.1},{"word":"patterns","start":502.1,"end":503.02},{"word":"of","start":503.02,"end":503.2},{"word":"neuroplasticity","start":503.2,"end":504.18},{"word":"are","start":504.18,"end":504.38},{"word":"highly","start":504.38,"end":504.94},{"word":"variable","start":504.94,"end":505.46},{"word":"from","start":505.46,"end":505.92},{"word":"person","start":505.92,"end":506.4}],"listenDifficulty":1},{"index":113,"start":506.4,"end":512.14,"textEn":"To person. Now as a researcher, variability used to drive me crazy.","textKo":"연구자로서, 변이성은 저를 미치게 했습니다.","words":[{"word":"to","start":506.4,"end":507.02},{"word":"person.","start":507.02,"end":507.44},{"word":"Now","start":508.16,"end":508.68},{"word":"as","start":508.68,"end":508.84},{"word":"a","start":508.84,"end":508.94},{"word":"researcher,","start":508.94,"end":509.48},{"word":"variability","start":510.02,"end":510.52},{"word":"used","start":510.52,"end":511.04},{"word":"to","start":511.04,"end":511.16},{"word":"drive","start":511.16,"end":511.4},{"word":"me","start":511.4,"end":511.58},{"word":"crazy.","start":511.58,"end":512.14}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":114,"start":512.5,"end":517.78,"textEn":"It makes it very difficult to use statistics to test your data and your ideas.","textKo":"데이터와 아이디어를 통계적으로 검증하기가 매우 어렵게 만듭니다.","words":[{"word":"It","start":512.5,"end":512.9},{"word":"makes","start":512.9,"end":513.14},{"word":"it","start":513.14,"end":513.36},{"word":"very","start":513.36,"end":514.04},{"word":"difficult","start":514.04,"end":514.42},{"word":"to","start":514.42,"end":514.7},{"word":"use","start":514.7,"end":514.86},{"word":"statistics","start":514.86,"end":515.48},{"word":"to","start":515.48,"end":515.88},{"word":"test","start":515.88,"end":516.2},{"word":"your","start":516.2,"end":516.36},{"word":"data","start":516.36,"end":516.66},{"word":"and","start":516.66,"end":517.22},{"word":"your","start":517.22,"end":517.36},{"word":"ideas.","start":517.36,"end":517.78}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":115,"start":518.18,"end":523.46,"textEn":"And because of this, medical intervention studies are specifically designed to minimize","textKo":"이 때문에, 의학적 중재 연구는 특별히","words":[{"word":"And","start":518.18,"end":518.52},{"word":"because","start":518.52,"end":518.82},{"word":"of","start":518.82,"end":519.06},{"word":"this,","start":519.06,"end":519.42},{"word":"medical","start":519.76,"end":520.0},{"word":"intervention","start":520.0,"end":520.4},{"word":"studies","start":520.4,"end":520.84},{"word":"are","start":520.84,"end":521.12},{"word":"specifically","start":521.12,"end":521.9},{"word":"designed","start":521.9,"end":522.52},{"word":"to","start":522.52,"end":523.0},{"word":"minimize","start":523.0,"end":523.46}],"listenDifficulty":1},{"index":116,"start":523.46,"end":530.62,"textEn":"Variability. But in my research, it''s becoming really clear that the most important, the most informative","textKo":"변이성을 최소화하도록 설계됩니다. 하지만 제 연구에서는 가장 중요하고 가장 유익한","words":[{"word":"variability.","start":523.46,"end":524.12},{"word":"But","start":524.66,"end":525.44},{"word":"in","start":525.44,"end":525.56},{"word":"my","start":525.56,"end":525.74},{"word":"research,","start":525.74,"end":526.16},{"word":"it''s","start":526.34,"end":526.62},{"word":"becoming","start":526.62,"end":526.98},{"word":"really","start":526.98,"end":527.56},{"word":"clear","start":527.56,"end":528.04},{"word":"that","start":528.04,"end":528.5},{"word":"the","start":528.5,"end":528.92},{"word":"most","start":528.92,"end":529.2},{"word":"important,","start":529.2,"end":529.68},{"word":"the","start":529.78,"end":529.86},{"word":"most","start":529.86,"end":530.04},{"word":"informative","start":530.04,"end":530.62}],"listenDifficulty":1},{"index":117,"start":530.62,"end":534.04,"textEn":"Data that we collect is showing this variability.","textKo":"데이터가 이 변이성을 보여주고 있다는 것이 점점 분명해지고 있습니다.","words":[{"word":"data","start":530.62,"end":530.94},{"word":"that","start":530.94,"end":531.14},{"word":"we","start":531.14,"end":531.3},{"word":"collect","start":531.3,"end":531.72},{"word":"is","start":531.72,"end":532.7},{"word":"showing","start":532.7,"end":533.2},{"word":"this","start":533.2,"end":533.44},{"word":"variability.","start":533.44,"end":534.04}],"listenDifficulty":1},{"index":118,"start":536.68,"end":540.74,"textEn":"So by studying the brain after stroke, we''ve learned a lot.","textKo":"뇌졸중 후의 뇌를 연구함으로써, 우리는 많은 것을 배웠습니다.","words":[{"word":"So","start":536.31,"end":536.7},{"word":"by","start":536.7,"end":537.12},{"word":"studying","start":537.12,"end":537.58},{"word":"the","start":537.58,"end":537.9},{"word":"brain","start":537.9,"end":538.18},{"word":"after","start":538.18,"end":538.56},{"word":"stroke,","start":538.56,"end":539.24},{"word":"we''ve","start":539.58,"end":540.1},{"word":"learned","start":540.1,"end":540.3},{"word":"a","start":540.3,"end":540.48},{"word":"lot.","start":540.48,"end":540.74}],"listenDifficulty":3},{"index":119,"start":540.74,"end":545.04,"textEn":"And I think these lessons are very valuable in other areas.","textKo":"그리고 이 교훈들은 다른 분야에서도 매우 가치 있다고 생각합니다.","words":[{"word":"And","start":540.74,"end":541.2},{"word":"I","start":541.2,"end":541.56},{"word":"think","start":541.56,"end":541.76},{"word":"these","start":541.76,"end":542.0},{"word":"lessons","start":542.0,"end":542.46},{"word":"are","start":542.46,"end":542.86},{"word":"very","start":542.86,"end":543.46},{"word":"valuable","start":543.46,"end":544.06},{"word":"in","start":544.06,"end":544.4},{"word":"other","start":544.4,"end":544.58},{"word":"areas.","start":544.58,"end":545.04}],"listenDifficulty":1},{"index":120,"start":546.14,"end":551.28,"textEn":"So the first lesson is that the primary driver of change in your brain is your behavior.","textKo":"첫 번째 교훈은 뇌 변화의 주요 동력은 여러분의 행동이라는 것입니다.","words":[{"word":"So","start":546.14,"end":546.7},{"word":"the","start":546.7,"end":546.84},{"word":"first","start":546.84,"end":547.12},{"word":"lesson","start":547.12,"end":547.44},{"word":"is","start":547.44,"end":547.6},{"word":"that","start":547.6,"end":547.74},{"word":"the","start":547.74,"end":547.88},{"word":"primary","start":547.88,"end":548.36},{"word":"driver","start":548.36,"end":548.82},{"word":"of","start":548.82,"end":549.1},{"word":"change","start":549.1,"end":549.36},{"word":"in","start":549.36,"end":549.72},{"word":"your","start":549.72,"end":550.06},{"word":"brain","start":550.06,"end":550.46},{"word":"is","start":550.46,"end":550.72},{"word":"your","start":550.72,"end":550.88},{"word":"behavior.","start":550.88,"end":551.28}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":121,"start":551.66,"end":554.74,"textEn":"So there''s no neuroplasticity drug you can take.","textKo":"복용할 수 있는 신경가소성 약은 없습니다.","words":[{"word":"So","start":551.66,"end":552.2},{"word":"there''s","start":552.2,"end":552.42},{"word":"no","start":552.42,"end":552.66},{"word":"neuroplasticity","start":552.66,"end":553.7},{"word":"drug","start":553.7,"end":553.96},{"word":"you","start":553.96,"end":554.14},{"word":"can","start":554.14,"end":554.3},{"word":"take.","start":554.3,"end":554.74}],"listenDifficulty":1},{"index":122,"start":555.68,"end":559.14,"textEn":"Nothing is more effective than practice at helping you learn.","textKo":"학습을 돕는 데 연습보다 더 효과적인 것은 없습니다.","words":[{"word":"Nothing","start":555.68,"end":556.24},{"word":"is","start":556.24,"end":556.54},{"word":"more","start":556.54,"end":556.74},{"word":"effective","start":556.74,"end":557.1},{"word":"than","start":557.1,"end":557.32},{"word":"practice","start":557.32,"end":557.8},{"word":"at","start":557.8,"end":558.3},{"word":"helping","start":558.3,"end":558.58},{"word":"you","start":558.58,"end":558.78},{"word":"learn.","start":558.78,"end":559.14}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":123,"start":559.34,"end":562.58,"textEn":"And the bottom line is, you have to do the work.","textKo":"핵심은, 여러분이 직접 노력해야 한다는 것입니다.","words":[{"word":"And","start":559.34,"end":559.46},{"word":"the","start":559.46,"end":559.8},{"word":"bottom","start":559.8,"end":560.16},{"word":"line","start":560.16,"end":560.4},{"word":"is,","start":560.4,"end":560.7},{"word":"you","start":560.8,"end":561.04},{"word":"have","start":561.04,"end":561.34},{"word":"to","start":561.34,"end":561.58},{"word":"do","start":561.58,"end":561.86},{"word":"the","start":561.86,"end":562.28},{"word":"work.","start":562.28,"end":562.58}],"listenDifficulty":3},{"index":124,"start":563.64,"end":569.6,"textEn":"And in fact, my research has shown that increased difficulty, increased struggle, if you will, during","textKo":"사실, 제 연구에 따르면 연습 중 난이도가 높을수록, 더 힘들수록","words":[{"word":"And","start":563.64,"end":564.2},{"word":"in","start":564.2,"end":564.3},{"word":"fact,","start":564.3,"end":564.46},{"word":"my","start":564.62,"end":564.76},{"word":"research","start":564.76,"end":565.12},{"word":"has","start":565.12,"end":565.42},{"word":"shown","start":565.42,"end":565.76},{"word":"that","start":565.76,"end":566.26},{"word":"increased","start":566.26,"end":566.9},{"word":"difficulty,","start":566.9,"end":567.62},{"word":"increased","start":567.82,"end":568.16},{"word":"struggle,","start":568.16,"end":568.76},{"word":"if","start":568.8,"end":569.02},{"word":"you","start":569.02,"end":569.16},{"word":"will,","start":569.16,"end":569.34},{"word":"during","start":569.46,"end":569.6}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":125,"start":569.6,"end":575.36,"textEn":"Practice actually leads to both more learning and greater structural change in the brain.","textKo":"실제로 더 많은 학습과 뇌의 더 큰 구조적 변화로 이어집니다.","words":[{"word":"practice","start":569.6,"end":570.08},{"word":"actually","start":570.08,"end":571.1},{"word":"leads","start":571.1,"end":571.52},{"word":"to","start":571.52,"end":571.66},{"word":"both","start":571.66,"end":571.84},{"word":"more","start":571.84,"end":572.2},{"word":"learning","start":572.2,"end":572.7},{"word":"and","start":572.7,"end":573.24},{"word":"greater","start":573.24,"end":573.8},{"word":"structural","start":573.8,"end":574.3},{"word":"change","start":574.3,"end":574.76},{"word":"in","start":574.76,"end":574.98},{"word":"the","start":574.98,"end":575.06},{"word":"brain.","start":575.06,"end":575.36}],"listenDifficulty":1},{"index":126,"start":577.98,"end":581.74,"textEn":"The problem here is, is that neuroplasticity can work both ways.","textKo":"여기서 문제는 신경가소성이 양방향으로 작용할 수 있다는 것입니다.","words":[{"word":"The","start":577.66,"end":578.0},{"word":"problem","start":578.0,"end":578.4},{"word":"here","start":578.4,"end":578.64},{"word":"is,","start":578.64,"end":579.02},{"word":"is","start":579.06,"end":579.14},{"word":"that","start":579.14,"end":579.32},{"word":"neuroplasticity","start":579.32,"end":580.3},{"word":"can","start":580.3,"end":580.5},{"word":"work","start":580.5,"end":580.86},{"word":"both","start":580.86,"end":581.3},{"word":"ways.","start":581.3,"end":581.74}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":127,"start":582.3,"end":586.82,"textEn":"It can be positive. You learn something new and you refine the motor skill.","textKo":"긍정적일 수 있습니다. 새로운 것을 배우고 운동 기술을 다듬는 것이죠.","words":[{"word":"It","start":582.3,"end":582.8},{"word":"can","start":582.8,"end":582.92},{"word":"be","start":582.92,"end":583.06},{"word":"positive.","start":583.06,"end":583.62},{"word":"You","start":584.0,"end":584.34},{"word":"learn","start":584.34,"end":584.5},{"word":"something","start":584.5,"end":584.82},{"word":"new","start":584.82,"end":585.26},{"word":"and","start":585.26,"end":585.64},{"word":"you","start":585.64,"end":585.82},{"word":"refine","start":585.82,"end":586.2},{"word":"the","start":586.2,"end":586.32},{"word":"motor","start":586.32,"end":586.48},{"word":"skill.","start":586.48,"end":586.82}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":128,"start":587.96,"end":591.2,"textEn":"It also can be negative though. You forgot something you once knew.","textKo":"하지만 부정적일 수도 있습니다. 한때 알았던 것을 잊어버리는 것이죠.","words":[{"word":"It","start":587.64,"end":587.98},{"word":"also","start":587.98,"end":588.16},{"word":"can","start":588.16,"end":588.32},{"word":"be","start":588.32,"end":588.46},{"word":"negative","start":588.46,"end":588.92},{"word":"though.","start":588.92,"end":589.24},{"word":"You","start":589.5,"end":589.8},{"word":"forgot","start":589.8,"end":590.06},{"word":"something","start":590.06,"end":590.46},{"word":"you","start":590.46,"end":590.66},{"word":"once","start":590.66,"end":590.9},{"word":"knew.","start":590.9,"end":591.2}],"listenDifficulty":3},{"index":129,"start":591.44,"end":595.22,"textEn":"You become addicted to drugs. Maybe you have chronic pain.","textKo":"약물에 중독되기도 합니다. 만성 통증을 겪기도 하죠.","words":[{"word":"You","start":591.44,"end":591.8},{"word":"become","start":591.8,"end":592.04},{"word":"addicted","start":592.04,"end":592.38},{"word":"to","start":592.38,"end":592.66},{"word":"drugs.","start":592.66,"end":593.12},{"word":"Maybe","start":593.82,"end":594.16},{"word":"you","start":594.16,"end":594.26},{"word":"have","start":594.26,"end":594.4},{"word":"chronic","start":594.4,"end":594.72},{"word":"pain.","start":594.72,"end":595.22}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":130,"start":595.22,"end":601.48,"textEn":"You learn something new and you learn something new and you learn something new and you learn So your brain is tremendously plastic and it''s being shaped both structurally and functionally","textKo":"여러분의 뇌는 엄청나게 가소적이며 구조적으로나 기능적으로","words":[{"word":"You","start":595.22,"end":596.16},{"word":"learn","start":596.16,"end":596.16},{"word":"something","start":596.16,"end":596.16},{"word":"new","start":596.16,"end":596.16},{"word":"and","start":596.16,"end":596.16},{"word":"you","start":596.16,"end":596.16},{"word":"learn","start":596.16,"end":596.16},{"word":"something","start":596.16,"end":596.16},{"word":"new","start":596.16,"end":596.16},{"word":"and","start":596.16,"end":596.16},{"word":"you","start":596.16,"end":596.16},{"word":"learn","start":596.16,"end":596.16},{"word":"something","start":596.16,"end":596.16},{"word":"new","start":596.16,"end":596.16},{"word":"and","start":596.16,"end":596.16},{"word":"you","start":596.16,"end":596.16},{"word":"learn","start":596.16,"end":596.16},{"word":"So","start":596.16,"end":596.16},{"word":"your","start":596.16,"end":596.32},{"word":"brain","start":596.32,"end":596.7},{"word":"is","start":596.7,"end":596.98},{"word":"tremendously","start":596.98,"end":597.62},{"word":"plastic","start":597.62,"end":598.24},{"word":"and","start":598.24,"end":598.62},{"word":"it''s","start":598.62,"end":598.84},{"word":"being","start":598.84,"end":598.98},{"word":"shaped","start":598.98,"end":599.52},{"word":"both","start":599.52,"end":599.78},{"word":"structurally","start":599.78,"end":600.52},{"word":"and","start":600.52,"end":600.8},{"word":"functionally","start":600.8,"end":601.48}],"listenDifficulty":3},{"index":131,"start":601.48,"end":605.34,"textEn":"By everything you do, but also by everything that you don''t do.","textKo":"여러분이 하는 모든 것뿐만 아니라, 하지 않는 모든 것에 의해서도 형성됩니다.","words":[{"word":"by","start":601.48,"end":601.62},{"word":"everything","start":601.62,"end":602.0},{"word":"you","start":602.0,"end":602.2},{"word":"do,","start":602.2,"end":602.5},{"word":"but","start":603.06,"end":603.46},{"word":"also","start":603.46,"end":603.78},{"word":"by","start":603.78,"end":603.94},{"word":"everything","start":603.94,"end":604.34},{"word":"that","start":604.34,"end":604.58},{"word":"you","start":604.58,"end":604.74},{"word":"don''t","start":604.74,"end":605.12},{"word":"do.","start":605.12,"end":605.34}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":132,"start":607.14,"end":612.48,"textEn":"The second lesson we''ve learned about the brain is that there is no one-size-fits-all approach","textKo":"뇌에 대해 배운 두 번째 교훈은 학습에 대한 만능 접근법은 없다는 것입니다.","words":[{"word":"The","start":606.88,"end":607.2},{"word":"second","start":607.2,"end":607.56},{"word":"lesson","start":607.56,"end":608.0},{"word":"we''ve","start":608.0,"end":608.44},{"word":"learned","start":608.44,"end":608.64},{"word":"about","start":608.64,"end":608.86},{"word":"the","start":608.86,"end":609.04},{"word":"brain","start":609.04,"end":609.38},{"word":"is","start":609.38,"end":609.62},{"word":"that","start":609.62,"end":609.82},{"word":"there","start":609.82,"end":610.08},{"word":"is","start":610.08,"end":610.28},{"word":"no","start":610.28,"end":610.66},{"word":"one","start":610.66,"end":611.32},{"word":"-size","start":611.32,"end":611.58},{"word":"-fits","start":611.58,"end":611.88},{"word":"-all","start":611.88,"end":612.1},{"word":"approach","start":612.1,"end":612.48}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":133,"start":612.48,"end":616.32,"textEn":"To learning. So there''s no recipe for learning.","textKo":"학습에 대한 레시피는 없습니다.","words":[{"word":"to","start":612.48,"end":612.74},{"word":"learning.","start":612.74,"end":613.1},{"word":"So","start":614.26,"end":614.58},{"word":"there''s","start":614.58,"end":614.98},{"word":"no","start":614.98,"end":615.1},{"word":"recipe","start":615.1,"end":615.6},{"word":"for","start":615.6,"end":615.94},{"word":"learning.","start":615.94,"end":616.32}],"listenDifficulty":1},{"index":134,"start":616.6,"end":621.76,"textEn":"Consider the popular belief that it takes 10,000 hours of practice to learn and to master","textKo":"새로운 운동 기술을 배우고 마스터하는 데 1만 시간의 연습이 필요하다는","words":[{"word":"Consider","start":616.6,"end":617.24},{"word":"the","start":617.24,"end":617.44},{"word":"popular","start":617.44,"end":617.82},{"word":"belief","start":617.82,"end":618.18},{"word":"that","start":618.18,"end":618.38},{"word":"it","start":618.38,"end":618.46},{"word":"takes","start":618.46,"end":618.72},{"word":"10","start":618.72,"end":619.04},{"word":",000","start":619.04,"end":619.44},{"word":"hours","start":619.44,"end":619.72},{"word":"of","start":619.72,"end":619.92},{"word":"practice","start":619.92,"end":620.3},{"word":"to","start":620.3,"end":620.7},{"word":"learn","start":620.7,"end":621.0},{"word":"and","start":621.0,"end":621.24},{"word":"to","start":621.24,"end":621.36},{"word":"master","start":621.36,"end":621.76}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":135,"start":621.76,"end":626.28,"textEn":"A new motor skill. Now I can assure you, it is not quite that simple.","textKo":"대중적인 믿음을 생각해 보세요. 그렇게 단순하지 않다고 장담할 수 있습니다.","words":[{"word":"a","start":621.76,"end":622.06},{"word":"new","start":622.06,"end":622.22},{"word":"motor","start":622.22,"end":622.46},{"word":"skill.","start":622.46,"end":622.82},{"word":"Now","start":622.82,"end":623.76},{"word":"I","start":623.76,"end":623.9},{"word":"can","start":623.9,"end":624.06},{"word":"assure","start":624.06,"end":624.44},{"word":"you,","start":624.44,"end":624.7},{"word":"it","start":624.98,"end":625.0},{"word":"is","start":625.0,"end":625.12},{"word":"not","start":625.12,"end":625.46},{"word":"quite","start":625.46,"end":625.7},{"word":"that","start":625.7,"end":625.92},{"word":"simple.","start":625.92,"end":626.28}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":136,"start":626.72,"end":631.48,"textEn":"For some of us, it''s going to take a lot more practice and for others it may take far","textKo":"어떤 사람들에게는 훨씬 더 많은 연습이 필요할 것이고, 다른 사람들에게는","words":[{"word":"For","start":626.72,"end":627.24},{"word":"some","start":627.24,"end":627.5},{"word":"of","start":627.5,"end":627.64},{"word":"us,","start":627.64,"end":627.8},{"word":"it''s","start":627.88,"end":628.02},{"word":"going","start":628.02,"end":628.1},{"word":"to","start":628.1,"end":628.18},{"word":"take","start":628.18,"end":628.32},{"word":"a","start":628.32,"end":628.42},{"word":"lot","start":628.42,"end":628.58},{"word":"more","start":628.58,"end":628.84},{"word":"practice","start":628.84,"end":629.34},{"word":"and","start":629.34,"end":629.72},{"word":"for","start":629.72,"end":629.88},{"word":"others","start":629.88,"end":630.14},{"word":"it","start":630.14,"end":630.3},{"word":"may","start":630.3,"end":630.46},{"word":"take","start":630.46,"end":630.86},{"word":"far","start":630.86,"end":631.48}],"listenDifficulty":3},{"index":137,"start":631.48,"end":638.3,"textEn":"Less. So the shaping of our plastic brains is far too unique for there to be any single intervention","textKo":"훨씬 적게 필요할 수도 있습니다. 우리의 가소적 뇌의 형성은 너무나 독특해서 어떤 단일 중재법도","words":[{"word":"less.","start":631.48,"end":631.98},{"word":"So","start":632.56,"end":633.08},{"word":"the","start":633.08,"end":633.22},{"word":"shaping","start":633.22,"end":633.64},{"word":"of","start":633.64,"end":633.9},{"word":"our","start":633.9,"end":634.16},{"word":"plastic","start":634.16,"end":634.64},{"word":"brains","start":634.64,"end":635.16},{"word":"is","start":635.16,"end":635.48},{"word":"far","start":635.48,"end":636.04},{"word":"too","start":636.04,"end":636.22},{"word":"unique","start":636.22,"end":636.74},{"word":"for","start":636.74,"end":636.96},{"word":"there","start":636.96,"end":637.06},{"word":"to","start":637.06,"end":637.16},{"word":"be","start":637.16,"end":637.28},{"word":"any","start":637.28,"end":637.46},{"word":"single","start":637.46,"end":637.84},{"word":"intervention","start":637.84,"end":638.3}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":138,"start":638.3,"end":645.62,"textEn":"That''s going to work for all of us. And now this realization have forced us to consider something called personalized medicine.","textKo":"우리 모두에게 효과가 있을 수는 없습니다. 이 깨달음은 우리에게 개인 맞춤 의학이라는 것을 고려하도록 강제했습니다.","words":[{"word":"that''s","start":638.3,"end":638.64},{"word":"going","start":638.64,"end":638.8},{"word":"to","start":638.8,"end":638.96},{"word":"work","start":638.96,"end":639.14},{"word":"for","start":639.14,"end":639.56},{"word":"all","start":639.56,"end":639.78},{"word":"of","start":639.78,"end":639.94},{"word":"us.","start":639.94,"end":640.28},{"word":"And","start":640.96,"end":641.36},{"word":"now","start":641.36,"end":641.5},{"word":"this","start":641.5,"end":641.76},{"word":"realization","start":641.76,"end":642.44},{"word":"have","start":642.44,"end":642.8},{"word":"forced","start":642.8,"end":643.12},{"word":"us","start":643.12,"end":643.28},{"word":"to","start":643.28,"end":643.44},{"word":"consider","start":643.44,"end":643.82},{"word":"something","start":643.82,"end":644.1},{"word":"called","start":644.1,"end":644.38},{"word":"personalized","start":644.38,"end":644.98},{"word":"medicine.","start":644.98,"end":645.62}],"listenDifficulty":3},{"index":139,"start":645.62,"end":652.3,"textEn":"So this is the idea that to optimize outcomes, each individual requires their own intervention.","textKo":"이것은 결과를 최적화하기 위해 각 개인이 자신만의 중재법이 필요하다는 생각입니다.","words":[{"word":"So","start":645.62,"end":646.64},{"word":"this","start":646.64,"end":646.8},{"word":"is","start":646.8,"end":646.92},{"word":"the","start":646.92,"end":647.02},{"word":"idea","start":647.02,"end":647.42},{"word":"that","start":647.42,"end":647.66},{"word":"to","start":647.66,"end":647.9},{"word":"optimize","start":647.9,"end":648.32},{"word":"outcomes,","start":648.32,"end":649.08},{"word":"each","start":649.32,"end":649.5},{"word":"individual","start":649.5,"end":650.08},{"word":"requires","start":650.08,"end":650.78},{"word":"their","start":650.78,"end":651.32},{"word":"own","start":651.32,"end":651.7},{"word":"intervention.","start":651.7,"end":652.3}],"listenDifficulty":1},{"index":140,"start":652.68,"end":655.02,"textEn":"And the idea actually comes from cancer treatments.","textKo":"이 아이디어는 실제로 암 치료에서 왔습니다.","words":[{"word":"And","start":652.68,"end":653.16},{"word":"the","start":653.16,"end":653.26},{"word":"idea","start":653.26,"end":653.46},{"word":"actually","start":653.46,"end":653.72},{"word":"comes","start":653.72,"end":653.98},{"word":"from","start":653.98,"end":654.14},{"word":"cancer","start":654.14,"end":654.56},{"word":"treatments.","start":654.56,"end":655.02}],"listenDifficulty":3},{"index":141,"start":655.4,"end":660.82,"textEn":"And here it turns out that genetics are very important in matching certain types of chemotherapy","textKo":"여기서 유전학이 특정 유형의 화학 요법을 매칭하는 데 매우 중요하다는 것이 밝혀졌습니다.","words":[{"word":"And","start":655.4,"end":655.94},{"word":"here","start":655.94,"end":656.12},{"word":"it","start":656.12,"end":656.24},{"word":"turns","start":656.24,"end":656.4},{"word":"out","start":656.4,"end":656.62},{"word":"that","start":656.62,"end":656.8},{"word":"genetics","start":656.8,"end":657.32},{"word":"are","start":657.32,"end":657.64},{"word":"very","start":657.64,"end":657.94},{"word":"important","start":657.94,"end":658.4},{"word":"in","start":658.4,"end":658.6},{"word":"matching","start":658.6,"end":659.04},{"word":"certain","start":659.04,"end":659.5},{"word":"types","start":659.5,"end":659.88},{"word":"of","start":659.88,"end":660.2},{"word":"chemotherapy","start":660.2,"end":660.82}],"listenDifficulty":3},{"index":142,"start":661.46,"end":663.96,"textEn":"With specific forms of cancer. cancer.","textKo":"특정 형태의 암과 말이죠.","words":[{"word":"with","start":661.18,"end":661.56},{"word":"specific","start":661.56,"end":661.96},{"word":"forms","start":661.96,"end":662.36},{"word":"of","start":662.36,"end":662.5},{"word":"cancer.","start":662.5,"end":663.0},{"word":"cancer.","start":663.0,"end":663.96}],"listenDifficulty":1},{"index":143,"start":664.18,"end":667.56,"textEn":"My research is showing that this also applies to recovery from stroke.","textKo":"제 연구는 이것이 뇌졸중 회복에도 적용된다는 것을 보여주고 있습니다.","words":[{"word":"My","start":664.18,"end":664.74},{"word":"research","start":664.74,"end":665.04},{"word":"is","start":665.04,"end":665.22},{"word":"showing","start":665.22,"end":665.44},{"word":"that","start":665.44,"end":665.66},{"word":"this","start":665.66,"end":665.8},{"word":"also","start":665.8,"end":666.08},{"word":"applies","start":666.08,"end":666.42},{"word":"to","start":666.42,"end":666.58},{"word":"recovery","start":666.58,"end":666.92},{"word":"from","start":666.92,"end":667.16},{"word":"stroke.","start":667.16,"end":667.56}],"listenDifficulty":3},{"index":144,"start":667.94,"end":672.12,"textEn":"So there are certain characteristics of brain structure and function that we call biomarkers.","textKo":"바이오마커라고 부르는 뇌 구조와 기능의 특정 특성이 있습니다.","words":[{"word":"So","start":667.94,"end":668.5},{"word":"there","start":668.5,"end":668.62},{"word":"are","start":668.62,"end":668.72},{"word":"certain","start":668.72,"end":668.96},{"word":"characteristics","start":668.96,"end":669.52},{"word":"of","start":669.52,"end":669.76},{"word":"brain","start":669.76,"end":669.96},{"word":"structure","start":669.96,"end":670.3},{"word":"and","start":670.3,"end":670.52},{"word":"function","start":670.52,"end":670.76},{"word":"that","start":670.76,"end":670.94},{"word":"we","start":670.94,"end":671.02},{"word":"call","start":671.02,"end":671.2},{"word":"biomarkers.","start":671.2,"end":672.12}],"listenDifficulty":3},{"index":145,"start":672.3,"end":678.26,"textEn":"And these biomarkers are proving to be very helpful in helping us to match specific therapies","textKo":"이 바이오마커들은 특정 치료법을 매칭하는 데 매우 유용한 것으로 입증되고 있습니다.","words":[{"word":"And","start":672.3,"end":672.72},{"word":"these","start":672.72,"end":672.9},{"word":"biomarkers","start":672.9,"end":673.56},{"word":"are","start":673.56,"end":673.72},{"word":"proving","start":673.72,"end":673.98},{"word":"to","start":673.98,"end":674.1},{"word":"be","start":674.1,"end":674.22},{"word":"very","start":674.22,"end":674.5},{"word":"helpful","start":674.5,"end":675.06},{"word":"in","start":675.06,"end":675.38},{"word":"helping","start":675.38,"end":676.08},{"word":"us","start":676.08,"end":676.28},{"word":"to","start":676.28,"end":676.44},{"word":"match","start":676.44,"end":676.78},{"word":"specific","start":676.78,"end":677.62},{"word":"therapies","start":677.62,"end":678.26}],"listenDifficulty":1},{"index":146,"start":678.88,"end":686.36,"textEn":"With individual patients. patients. And the data from my lab suggests it''s a combination of biomarkers that best predicts neuroplastic","textKo":"개별 환자에게 말이죠. 제 연구실의 데이터에 따르면 바이오마커의 조합이 신경가소적","words":[{"word":"with","start":678.76,"end":679.04},{"word":"individual","start":679.04,"end":679.58},{"word":"patients.","start":679.58,"end":680.26},{"word":"patients.","start":680.26,"end":680.46},{"word":"And","start":680.98,"end":681.32},{"word":"the","start":681.32,"end":681.6},{"word":"data","start":681.6,"end":681.8},{"word":"from","start":681.8,"end":681.98},{"word":"my","start":681.98,"end":682.24},{"word":"lab","start":682.24,"end":682.44},{"word":"suggests","start":682.44,"end":682.84},{"word":"it''s","start":682.84,"end":683.1},{"word":"a","start":683.1,"end":683.18},{"word":"combination","start":683.18,"end":683.64},{"word":"of","start":683.64,"end":684.06},{"word":"biomarkers","start":684.06,"end":684.68},{"word":"that","start":684.68,"end":684.86},{"word":"best","start":684.86,"end":685.2},{"word":"predicts","start":685.2,"end":685.72},{"word":"neuroplastic","start":685.72,"end":686.36}],"listenDifficulty":1},{"index":147,"start":686.36,"end":689.0,"textEn":"Change and patterns of recovery after stroke.","textKo":"변화와 뇌졸중 후 회복 패턴을 가장 잘 예측합니다.","words":[{"word":"change","start":686.36,"end":686.86},{"word":"and","start":686.86,"end":687.3},{"word":"patterns","start":687.3,"end":687.6},{"word":"of","start":687.6,"end":687.76},{"word":"recovery","start":687.76,"end":688.16},{"word":"after","start":688.16,"end":688.5},{"word":"stroke.","start":688.5,"end":689.0}],"listenDifficulty":1},{"index":148,"start":689.2,"end":693.26,"textEn":"And that''s not surprising given how complicated the human brain is.","textKo":"인간의 뇌가 얼마나 복잡한지를 고려하면 놀라운 일이 아닙니다.","words":[{"word":"And","start":689.2,"end":689.6},{"word":"that''s","start":689.6,"end":689.98},{"word":"not","start":689.98,"end":690.14},{"word":"surprising","start":690.14,"end":690.74},{"word":"given","start":690.74,"end":691.12},{"word":"how","start":691.12,"end":691.46},{"word":"complicated","start":691.46,"end":692.12},{"word":"the","start":692.12,"end":692.34},{"word":"human","start":692.34,"end":692.56},{"word":"brain","start":692.56,"end":692.84},{"word":"is.","start":692.84,"end":693.26}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":149,"start":694.44,"end":698.02,"textEn":"But I also think we can consider this concept much more broadly.","textKo":"하지만 이 개념을 훨씬 더 넓게 생각할 수 있다고도 봅니다.","words":[{"word":"But","start":694.1,"end":694.44},{"word":"I","start":694.44,"end":694.54},{"word":"also","start":694.54,"end":694.94},{"word":"think","start":694.94,"end":695.2},{"word":"we","start":695.2,"end":695.44},{"word":"can","start":695.44,"end":695.62},{"word":"consider","start":695.62,"end":695.98},{"word":"this","start":695.98,"end":696.26},{"word":"concept","start":696.26,"end":696.9},{"word":"much","start":696.9,"end":697.34},{"word":"more","start":697.34,"end":697.56},{"word":"broadly.","start":697.56,"end":698.02}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":150,"start":699.46,"end":705.7,"textEn":"Given the unique structure and function of each of our brains, what we''ve learned about neuroplasticity","textKo":"우리 각자의 뇌의 독특한 구조와 기능을 고려할 때, 뇌졸중 후 신경가소성에 대해 배운 것은","words":[{"word":"Given","start":699.46,"end":700.14},{"word":"the","start":700.14,"end":700.34},{"word":"unique","start":700.34,"end":700.72},{"word":"structure","start":700.72,"end":701.18},{"word":"and","start":701.18,"end":701.46},{"word":"function","start":701.46,"end":701.86},{"word":"of","start":701.86,"end":702.4},{"word":"each","start":702.4,"end":702.76},{"word":"of","start":702.76,"end":702.94},{"word":"our","start":702.94,"end":703.16},{"word":"brains,","start":703.16,"end":703.72},{"word":"what","start":703.96,"end":704.06},{"word":"we''ve","start":704.06,"end":704.34},{"word":"learned","start":704.34,"end":704.54},{"word":"about","start":704.54,"end":704.76},{"word":"neuroplasticity","start":704.76,"end":705.7}],"listenDifficulty":1},{"index":151,"start":705.7,"end":708.16,"textEn":"After stroke applies to everyone.","textKo":"모든 사람에게 적용됩니다.","words":[{"word":"after","start":705.7,"end":706.0},{"word":"stroke","start":706.0,"end":706.46},{"word":"applies","start":706.46,"end":707.02},{"word":"to","start":707.02,"end":707.64},{"word":"everyone.","start":707.64,"end":708.16}],"listenDifficulty":1},{"index":152,"start":710.42,"end":714.22,"textEn":"Behaviors that you employ in your everyday life are important.","textKo":"여러분의 일상생활에서 사용하는 행동이 중요합니다.","words":[{"word":"Behaviors","start":710.42,"end":711.1},{"word":"that","start":711.1,"end":711.42},{"word":"you","start":711.42,"end":711.74},{"word":"employ","start":711.74,"end":712.2},{"word":"in","start":712.2,"end":712.62},{"word":"your","start":712.62,"end":712.92},{"word":"everyday","start":712.92,"end":713.24},{"word":"life","start":713.24,"end":713.54},{"word":"are","start":713.54,"end":713.74},{"word":"important.","start":713.74,"end":714.22}],"listenDifficulty":1},{"index":153,"start":714.58,"end":722.2,"textEn":"Each of them is changing your brain. And I believe we have to consider not just personalized medicine, but personalized learning.","textKo":"그것들 각각이 여러분의 뇌를 변화시키고 있습니다. 그리고 저는 개인 맞춤 의학뿐만 아니라 개인 맞춤 학습도 고려해야 한다고 믿습니다.","words":[{"word":"Each","start":714.58,"end":715.12},{"word":"of","start":715.12,"end":715.24},{"word":"them","start":715.24,"end":715.4},{"word":"is","start":715.4,"end":715.58},{"word":"changing","start":715.58,"end":715.92},{"word":"your","start":715.92,"end":716.14},{"word":"brain.","start":716.14,"end":716.52},{"word":"And","start":717.06,"end":717.74},{"word":"I","start":717.74,"end":717.84},{"word":"believe","start":717.84,"end":718.04},{"word":"we","start":718.04,"end":718.2},{"word":"have","start":718.2,"end":718.34},{"word":"to","start":718.34,"end":718.46},{"word":"consider","start":718.46,"end":718.8},{"word":"not","start":718.8,"end":719.02},{"word":"just","start":719.02,"end":719.22},{"word":"personalized","start":719.22,"end":719.7},{"word":"medicine,","start":719.7,"end":720.44},{"word":"but","start":720.76,"end":720.96},{"word":"personalized","start":720.96,"end":721.56},{"word":"learning.","start":721.56,"end":722.2}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":154,"start":723.42,"end":727.96,"textEn":"The uniqueness of your brain will affect you, both as a learner and also as a teacher.","textKo":"여러분 뇌의 독특함은 학습자로서뿐만 아니라 교사로서도 여러분에게 영향을 미칠 것입니다.","words":[{"word":"The","start":723.12,"end":723.46},{"word":"uniqueness","start":723.46,"end":723.84},{"word":"of","start":723.84,"end":724.1},{"word":"your","start":724.1,"end":724.44},{"word":"brain","start":724.44,"end":724.8},{"word":"will","start":724.8,"end":725.02},{"word":"affect","start":725.02,"end":725.3},{"word":"you,","start":725.3,"end":725.7},{"word":"both","start":725.8,"end":725.98},{"word":"as","start":725.98,"end":726.14},{"word":"a","start":726.14,"end":726.26},{"word":"learner","start":726.26,"end":726.64},{"word":"and","start":726.64,"end":726.94},{"word":"also","start":726.94,"end":727.26},{"word":"as","start":727.26,"end":727.48},{"word":"a","start":727.48,"end":727.6},{"word":"teacher.","start":727.6,"end":727.96}],"listenDifficulty":3},{"index":155,"start":728.78,"end":735.08,"textEn":"And now this idea helps us to understand why some children can thrive in traditional education","textKo":"이 생각은 왜 어떤 아이들은 전통적인 교육 환경에서","words":[{"word":"And","start":728.78,"end":729.46},{"word":"now","start":729.46,"end":729.6},{"word":"this","start":729.6,"end":729.94},{"word":"idea","start":729.94,"end":730.3},{"word":"helps","start":730.3,"end":730.66},{"word":"us","start":730.66,"end":730.82},{"word":"to","start":730.82,"end":730.96},{"word":"understand","start":730.96,"end":731.62},{"word":"why","start":731.62,"end":732.18},{"word":"some","start":732.18,"end":732.52},{"word":"children","start":732.52,"end":733.04},{"word":"can","start":733.04,"end":733.4},{"word":"thrive","start":733.4,"end":733.84},{"word":"in","start":733.84,"end":734.14},{"word":"traditional","start":734.14,"end":734.54},{"word":"education","start":734.54,"end":735.08}],"listenDifficulty":1},{"index":156,"start":735.08,"end":743.08,"textEn":"Settings and others don''t. Why some of us can learn languages easily and yet others can pick up any sport and excel.","textKo":"잘 성장하고 다른 아이들은 그렇지 못하는지 이해하는 데 도움이 됩니다. 왜 어떤 사람들은 언어를 쉽게 배울 수 있고, 다른 사람들은 아무 스포츠나 잡으면 뛰어난지 말이죠.","words":[{"word":"settings","start":735.08,"end":735.64},{"word":"and","start":735.64,"end":736.08},{"word":"others","start":736.08,"end":736.36},{"word":"don''t.","start":736.36,"end":736.9},{"word":"Why","start":737.24,"end":737.68},{"word":"some","start":737.68,"end":737.84},{"word":"of","start":737.84,"end":737.92},{"word":"us","start":737.92,"end":738.08},{"word":"can","start":738.08,"end":738.22},{"word":"learn","start":738.22,"end":738.4},{"word":"languages","start":738.4,"end":738.82},{"word":"easily","start":738.82,"end":739.52},{"word":"and","start":739.52,"end":740.04},{"word":"yet","start":740.04,"end":740.2},{"word":"others","start":740.2,"end":740.52},{"word":"can","start":740.52,"end":740.78},{"word":"pick","start":740.78,"end":740.98},{"word":"up","start":740.98,"end":741.1},{"word":"any","start":741.1,"end":741.36},{"word":"sport","start":741.36,"end":741.86},{"word":"and","start":741.86,"end":742.7},{"word":"excel.","start":742.7,"end":743.08}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":157,"start":745.74,"end":751.34,"textEn":"So when you leave this room today, your brain will not be the same as when you entered this","textKo":"오늘 이 방을 나설 때, 여러분의 