ore","start":771.7,"end":771.86},{"word":"effective","start":771.86,"end":772.28},{"word":"interventions","start":772.28,"end":772.98},{"word":"and","start":772.98,"end":773.9},{"word":"allow","start":773.9,"end":774.18},{"word":"for","start":774.18,"end":774.44},{"word":"matches","start":774.44,"end":774.94}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":163,"start":774.94,"end":779.72,"textEn":"Between learners and teachers and patients and interventions.","textKo":"환자와 중재법 사이의 매칭을 가능하게 할 것입니다.","words":[{"word":"between","start":774.94,"end":775.5},{"word":"learners","start":775.5,"end":776.3},{"word":"and","start":776.3,"end":777.02},{"word":"teachers","start":777.02,"end":777.48},{"word":"and","start":777.48,"end":778.36},{"word":"patients","start":778.36,"end":778.92},{"word":"and","start":778.92,"end":779.12},{"word":"interventions.","start":779.12,"end":779.72}],"listenDifficulty":1},{"index":164,"start":780.96,"end":783.3,"textEn":"And this does not just apply to recovery from stroke.","textKo":"이것은 뇌졸중 회복에만 적용되는 것이 아닙니다.","words":[{"word":"And","start":780.66,"end":780.98},{"word":"this","start":780.98,"end":781.12},{"word":"does","start":781.12,"end":781.26},{"word":"not","start":781.26,"end":781.44},{"word":"just","start":781.44,"end":781.68},{"word":"apply","start":781.68,"end":782.02},{"word":"to","start":782.02,"end":782.2},{"word":"recovery","start":782.2,"end":782.52},{"word":"from","start":782.52,"end":782.8},{"word":"stroke.","start":782.8,"end":783.3}],"listenDifficulty":3},{"index":165,"start":783.3,"end":789.86,"textEn":"It applies to each of us as a parent, as a teacher, as a manager, and also because you''re","textKo":"부모로서, 교사로서, 관리자로서, 그리고 여러분이","words":[{"word":"It","start":783.3,"end":784.02},{"word":"applies","start":784.02,"end":784.32},{"word":"to","start":784.32,"end":784.48},{"word":"each","start":784.48,"end":784.72},{"word":"of","start":784.72,"end":784.9},{"word":"us","start":784.9,"end":785.22},{"word":"as","start":785.22,"end":785.52},{"word":