dex":30,"start":190.34,"end":195.14,"textEn":"About varying the amount of space between different letter combinations, about what makes great","textKo":"서로 다른 글자 조합 사이의 간격을 조절하는 것에 대해, 그리고 훌륭한","words":[{"word":"about","start":190.34,"end":190.74},{"word":"varying","start":190.74,"end":191.2},{"word":"the","start":191.2,"end":191.42},{"word":"amount","start":191.42,"end":191.62},{"word":"of","start":191.62,"end":191.74},{"word":"space","start":191.74,"end":192.04},{"word":"between","start":192.04,"end":192.36},{"word":"different","start":192.36,"end":192.66},{"word":"letter","start":192.66,"end":192.86},{"word":"combinations,","start":192.86,"end":193.48},{"word":"about","start":193.86,"end":194.26},{"word":"what","start":194.26,"end":194.48},{"word":"makes","start":194.48,"end":194.78},{"word":"great","start":194.78,"end":195.14}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":31,"start":195.14,"end":202.54,"textEn":"Typography great. It was beautiful, historical, artistically subtle in a way that science can''t","textKo":"타이포그래피를 만드는 것에 대해 배웠습니다. 그것은 아름답고, 역사적이며, 과학이 포착할 수 없는 방식으로 예술적으로 섬세했습니다.","words":[{"word":"typography","start":195.14,"end":195.9},{"word":"great.","start":195.9,"end":196.3},{"word":"It","start":197.14,"end":197.74},{"word":"was","start":197.74,"end":197.88},{"word":"beautiful,","start":197.88,"end":198.42},{"word":"historical,","start":198.86,"end":199.5},{"word":"artistically","start":200.12,"end":200.68},{"word":"subtle","start":200.68,"end":201.06},{"word":"in","start":201.06,"end":201.46},{"word":"a","start":201.46,"end":201.56},{"word":"way","start":201.56,"end":201.66},{"word":"that","start":201.66,"end":201.8},{"word":"science","start":201.8,"end":202.2},{"word":"can''t","start":202.2,"end":202.54}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":32,"start":202.54,"end":210.34,"textEn":"Capture. And I found it fascinating. None of this had even a hope of any practical application in my life.","textKo":"저는 그것이 매력적이라고 느꼈습니다. 이것들 중 어느 것도 제 인생에서 실용적으로 쓰일 희망조차 없었습니다.","wor