esigned it all into the Mac. It was the first computer with beautiful typography.","textKo":"그리고 우리는 그 모든 것을 맥에 담았습니다. 그것은 아름다운 타이포그래피를 가진 최초의 컴퓨터였습니다.","words":[{"word":"And","start":217.1,"end":217.84},{"word":"we","start":217.84,"end":217.98},{"word":"designed","start":217.98,"end":218.42},{"word":"it","start":218.42,"end":218.6},{"word":"all","start":218.6,"end":219.04},{"word":"into","start":219.04,"end":219.4},{"word":"the","start":219.4,"end":219.52},{"word":"Mac.","start":219.52,"end":219.72},{"word":"It","start":220.02,"end":220.42},{"word":"was","start":220.42,"end":220.54},{"word":"the","start":220.54,"end":220.66},{"word":"first","start":220.66,"end":220.86},{"word":"computer","start":220.86,"end":221.28},{"word":"with","start":221.28,"end":221.5},{"word":"beautiful","start":221.5,"end":222.0},{"word":"typography.","start":222.0,"end":222.64}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":35,"start":223.26,"end":228.62,"textEn":"If I had never dropped in on that single course in college, the Mac would have never had multiple","textKo":"제가 대학에서 그 한 과목을 청강하지 않았다면, 맥에는 여러 가지","words":[{"word":"If","start":223.26,"end":223.8},{"word":"I","start":223.8,"end":223.92},{"word":"had","start":223.92,"end":224.06},{"word":"never","start":224.06,"end":224.32},{"word":"dropped","start":224.32,"end":224.68},{"word":"in","start":224.68,"end":224.98},{"word":"on","start":224.98,"end":225.16},{"word":"that","start":225.16,"end":225.32},{"word":"single","start":225.32,"end":225.66},{"word":"course","start":225.66,"end":226.04},{"word":"in","start":226.04,"end":226.2},{"word":"college,","start":226.2,"end":226.62},{"word":"the","start":227.02,"end":227.24},{"word":"Mac","start":227.24,"end":227.44},{"word":"would","start":227.44,"end":227.64},{"word":"have","start":227.64,"end":227.74},{"word":"never","start":227.74,"end":227.98},{"word":"had","start":227.98,"end":228.22},{"word":"multiple","start":228.22,"end":228.62}],"listenDifficulty":3},{"index":36,"start":228.62,"end":234.64,"textE