":2},{"index":38,"start":240.62,"end":245.1,"textEn":"Calligraphy class. And personal computers might not have the wonderful typography that they do.","textKo":"청강하지 않았을 것입니다. 그리고 개인용 컴퓨터는 지금 같은 멋진 타이포그래피를 갖지 못했을 수도 있습니다.","words":[{"word":"calligraphy","start":240.62,"end":241.12},{"word":"class.","start":241.12,"end":241.46},{"word":"And","start":241.46,"end":241.86},{"word":"personal","start":241.86,"end":242.24},{"word":"computers","start":242.24,"end":242.68},{"word":"might","start":242.68,"end":242.96},{"word":"not","start":242.96,"end":243.14},{"word":"have","start":243.14,"end":243.38},{"word":"the","start":243.38,"end":243.54},{"word":"wonderful","start":243.54,"end":243.86},{"word":"typography","start":243.86,"end":244.56},{"word":"that","start":244.56,"end":244.76},{"word":"they","start":244.76,"end":244.9},{"word":"do.","start":244.9,"end":245.1}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":39,"start":245.1,"end":250.98,"textEn":"Of course, it was impossible to connect the dots looking forward when I was in college. But it was","textKo":"물론 대학에 있을 때 앞을 내다보며 점들을 연결하는 것은 불가능했습니다. 하지만","words":[{"word":"Of","start":245.1,"end":246.1},{"word":"course,","start":246.1,"end":246.42},{"word":"it","start":246.62,"end":246.7},{"word":"was","start":246.7,"end":246.86},{"word":"impossible","start":246.86,"end":247.42},{"word":"to","start":247.42,"end":247.64},{"word":"connect","start":247.64,"end":247.94},{"word":"the","start":247.94,"end":248.12},{"word":"dots","start":248.12,"end":248.36},{"word":"looking","start":248.36,"end":248.64},{"word":"forward","start":248.64,"end":249.02},{"word":"when","start":249.02,"end":249.22},{"word":"I","start":249.22,"end":249.34},{"word":"was","start":249.34,"end":249.48},{"word":"in","start":249.48,"end":249.6},{"word":"college.","start":249.6,"end":249.94},{"word":"But","start":250.4,"end":250.78},{"word":"it","start":250.78,"end":250.86},{"word":"was","start":250.86,"end":250.98}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":40,"start":250.98,"end":257.44,"textEn":"Very, very clear looking backwards ten years later. Again, you can''t connect the dots looking forward.","textKo":"10년 후 뒤돌아보면 매우, 매우 명확했습니다. 다시 말하지만, 앞을 내다보며 점들을 연결할 수는 없습니다.","words":[{"word":"very,","start":250.98,"end":251.34},{"word":"very","start":251.34,"end":251.66},{"word":"clear","start":251.66,"end":252.02},{"word":"looking","start":252.02,"end":252.36},{"word":"backwards","start":252.36,"end":252.9},{"word":"ten","start":252.9,"end":253.3},{"word":"years","start":253.3,"end":253.58},{"word":"later.","start":253.58,"end":253.88},{"word":"Again,","start":254.76,"end":255.12},{"word":"you","start":255.36,"end":255.74},{"word":"can''t","start":255.74,"end":256.12},{"word":"connect","start":256.12,"end":256.4},{"word":"the","start":256.4,"end":256.56},{"word":"dots","start":256.56,"end":256.8},{"word":"looking","start":256.8,"end":257.04},{"word":"forward.","start":257.04,"end":257.44}],"listenDifficulty":1},{"index":41,"start":257.64,"end":263.02,"textEn":"You can only connect them looking backwards. So you have to trust that the dots will somehow connect","textKo":"뒤돌아볼 때만 연결할 수 있습니다. 그래서 여러분은 점들이 미래에 어떻게든 연결될 것이라고 믿어야 합니다.","words":[{"word":"You","start":257.64,"end":257.88},{"word":"can","start":257.88,"end":258.04},{"word":"only","start":258.04,"end":258.24},{"word":"connect","start":258.24,"end":258.58},{"word":"them","start":258.58,"end":258.78},{"word":"looking","start":258.78,"end":259.2},{"word":"backwards.","start":259.2,"end":259.68},{"word":"So","start":260.1,"end":260.66},{"word":"you","start":260.66,"end":260.78},{"word":"have","start":260.78,"end":260.98},{"word":"to","start":260.98,"end":261.14},{"word":"trust","start":261.14,"end":261.46},{"word":"that","start":261.46,"end":261.68},{"word":"the","start":261.68,"end":261.78},{"word":"dots","start":261.78,"end":262.08},{"word":"will","start":262.08,"end":262.28},{"word":"somehow","start":262.28,"end":262.64},{"word":"connect","start":262.64,"end":263.02}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":42,"start":263.02,"end":269.7,"textEn":"In your future. You have to trust in something. Your gut, destiny, life, karma, whatever. Because","textKo":"무언가를 믿어야 합니다. 직감이든, 운명이든, 인생이든, 카르마든, 무엇이든요. 왜냐하면","words":[{"word":"in","start":263.02,"end":263.24},{"word":"your","start":263.24,"end":263.36},{"word":"future.","start":263.36,"end":263.68},{"word":"You","start":263.96,"end":264.44},{"word":"have","start":264.44,"end":264.58},{"word":"to","start":264.58,"end":264.7},{"word":"trust","start":264.7,"end":264.96},{"word":"in","start":264.96,"end":265.14},{"word":"something.","start":265.14,"end":265.56},{"word":"Your","start":265.96,"end":266.22},{"word":"gut,","start":266.22,"end":266.52},{"word":"destiny,","start":266.7,"end":267.18},{"word":"life,","start":267.36,"end":267.64},{"word":"karma,","start":267.88,"end":268.22},{"word":"whatever.","start":268.34,"end":268.62},{"word":"Because","start":269.14,"end":269.7}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":43,"start":269.7,"end":274.96,"textEn":"Believing that the dots will connect down the road will give you the confidence to follow your heart,","textKo":"점들이 언젠가 연결될 것이라고 믿는 것이 자신의 마음을 따를 자신감을 줄 것이기 때문입니다.","words":[{"word":"believing","start":269.7,"end":270.12},{"word":"that","start":270.12,"end":270.32},{"word":"the","start":270.32,"end":270.42},{"word":"dots","start":270.42,"end":270.72},{"word":"will","start":270.72,"end":270.9},{"word":"connect","start":270.9,"end":271.3},{"word":"down","start":271.3,"end":271.54},{"word":"the","start":271.54,"end":271.7},{"word":"road","start":271.7,"end":272.04},{"word":"will","start":272.04,"end":272.92},{"word":"give","start":272.92,"end":273.1},{"word":"you","start":273.1,"end":273.26},{"word":"the","start":273.26,"end":273.38},{"word":"confidence","start":273.38,"end":273.82},{"word":"to","start":273.82,"end":274.08},{"word":"follow","start":274.08,"end":274.4},{"word":"your","start":274.4,"end":274.62},{"word":"heart,","start":274.62,"end":274.96}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"in