art":62.72,"end":65.1,"textEn":"Nope. Nope.","textKo":"아니요. 아니요.","words":[{"word":"Nope.","start":62.72,"end":63.3},{"word":"Nope.","start":64.38,"end":65.1}],"listenDifficulty":1},{"index":11,"start":65.98,"end":68.54,"textEn":"When you see letters in an English word,","textKo":"영어 단어에서 글자를 볼 때,","words":[{"word":"When","start":65.98,"end":66.62},{"word":"you","start":66.62,"end":66.74},{"word":"see","start":66.74,"end":66.94},{"word":"letters","start":66.94,"end":67.34},{"word":"in","start":67.34,"end":67.64},{"word":"an","start":67.64,"end":67.8},{"word":"English","start":67.8,"end":68.12},{"word":"word,","start":68.12,"end":68.54}],"listenDifficulty":3},{"index":12,"start":68.78,"end":72.06,"textEn":"They won''t always be pronounced the same way.","textKo":"항상 같은 방식으로 발음되지는 않아요.","words":[{"word":"they","start":68.78,"end":69.18},{"word":"won''t","start":69.18,"end":69.56},{"word":"always","start":69.56,"end":70.04},{"word":"be","start":70.04,"end":70.34},{"word":"pronounced","start":70.34,"end":70.9},{"word":"the","start":70.9,"end":71.54},{"word":"same","start":71.54,"end":71.78},{"word":"way.","start":71.78,"end":72.06}],"listenDifficulty":3},{"index":13,"start":72.88,"end":75.64,"textEn":"Take the letter C for example.","textKo":"예를 들어 글자 C를 보세요.","words":[{"word":"Take","start":72.88,"end":73.64},{"word":"the","start":73.64,"end":74.02},{"word":"letter","start":74.02,"end":74.32},{"word":"C","start":74.32,"end":74.7},{"word":"for","start":74.7,"end":75.04},{"word":"example.","start":75.04,"end":75.64}],"listenDifficulty":4},{"index":14,"start":76.16,"end":79.22,"textEn":"In the word cup, it''s pronounced","textKo":"cup이라는 단어에서는 이렇게 발음돼요","words":[{"word":"In","start":76.16,"end":76.76},{"word":"the","start":76.76,"end":76.88},{"word":"word","start":76.88,"end":77.28},{"word":"cup,","start":77.28,"end":77.74},{"word":"it''s","start":78.1,"end":78.6},{"word":"pronounced","start":78.6,"end":79.22}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":15,"start":79.22,"end":83.78,"