.34}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":44,"start":180.88,"end":184.12,"textEn":"Obesity and smoking are among the leading preventable causes","textKo":"비만과 흡연은 세계적으로 예방 가능한 이환율과 사망률의","words":[{"word":"Obesity","start":180.88,"end":181.4},{"word":"and","start":181.4,"end":181.58},{"word":"smoking","start":181.58,"end":181.94},{"word":"are","start":181.94,"end":182.16},{"word":"among","start":182.16,"end":182.58},{"word":"the","start":182.58,"end":182.78},{"word":"leading","start":182.78,"end":183.22},{"word":"preventable","start":183.22,"end":183.76},{"word":"causes","start":183.76,"end":184.12}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":45,"start":184.12,"end":188.46,"textEn":"Of morbidity and mortality in the world. So back to my breath.","textKo":"주요 원인 중 하나입니다. 다시 제 호흡으로 돌아가 보겠습니다.","words":[{"word":"of","start":184.12,"end":184.34},{"word":"morbidity","start":184.34,"end":184.82},{"word":"and","start":184.82,"end":185.02},{"word":"mortality","start":185.02,"end":185.4},{"word":"in","start":185.4,"end":185.7},{"word":"the","start":185.7,"end":185.8},{"word":"world.","start":185.8,"end":186.1},{"word":"So","start":186.98,"end":187.62},{"word":"back","start":187.62,"end":187.84},{"word":"to","start":187.84,"end":188.0},{"word":"my","start":188.0,"end":188.14},{"word":"breath.","start":188.14,"end":188.46}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":46,"start":189.62,"end":192.1,"textEn":"What if instead of fighting our brains","textKo":"우리 뇌와 싸우거나","words":[{"word":"What","start":189.62,"end":189.94},{"word":"if","start":189.94,"end":190.1},{"word":"instead","start":190.1,"end":190.58},{"word":"of","start":190.58,"end":190.86},{"word":"fighting","start":190.86,"end":191.54},{"word":"our","start":191.54,"end":191.76},{"word":"brains","start":191.76,"end":192.1}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":47,"start":192.1,"end":194.16,"textEn":"Or trying to force ourselves to pay attention,","textKo":"억지로 집중하려고 하는 대신에,","words":[{"word":"or","start":192.1,"end":192.24},{"word":"trying","start":192.24,"