art":203.16,"end":205.66,"textEn":"In our momentary experience? I''ll give you an example.","textKo":"그냥 정말 호기심을 가져보면 어떨까요? 예를 들어 보겠습니다.","words":[{"word":"in","start":203.16,"end":203.38},{"word":"our","start":203.38,"end":203.48},{"word":"momentary","start":203.48,"end":203.98},{"word":"experience?","start":203.98,"end":204.5},{"word":"I''ll","start":204.7,"end":204.9},{"word":"give","start":204.9,"end":205.0},{"word":"you","start":205.0,"end":205.12},{"word":"an","start":205.12,"end":205.24},{"word":"example.","start":205.24,"end":205.66}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":52,"start":206.34,"end":209.96,"textEn":"In my lab, we studied whether mindfulness training could help people quit smoking.","textKo":"저희 연구실에서는 마음챙김 훈련이 사람들의 금연에 도움이 되는지 연구했습니다.","words":[{"word":"In","start":206.34,"end":206.82},{"word":"my","start":206.82,"end":206.96},{"word":"lab,","start":206.96,"end":207.2},{"word":"we","start":207.28,"end":207.34},{"word":"studied","start":207.34,"end":207.6},{"word":"whether","start":207.6,"end":207.82},{"word":"mindfulness","start":207.82,"end":208.26},{"word":"training","start":208.26,"end":208.62},{"word":"could","start":208.62,"end":208.82},{"word":"help","start":208.82,"end":209.0},{"word":"people","start":209.0,"end":209.26},{"word":"quit","start":209.26,"end":209.5},{"word":"smoking.","start":209.5,"end":209.96}],"listenDifficulty":3},{"index":53,"start":210.76,"end":214.46,"textEn":"Now, just like trying to force myself to pay attention on my breath,","textKo":"제가 억지로 호흡에 집중하려 했던 것처럼,","words":[{"word":"Now,","start":210.76,"end":211.36},{"word":"just","start":211.72,"end":212.06},{"word":"like","start":212.06,"end":212.26},{"word":"trying","start":212.26,"end":212.48},{"word":"to","start":212.48,"end":212.64},{"word":"force","start":212.64,"end":212.96},{"word":"myself","start":212.96,"end":213.32},{"word":"to","start":213.32,"end":213.5},{"word":"pay","start":213.5,"end":213.68},{"word":"attention","start":213.68,"end":213.9},{"word":"on","start":213.9,"end":214.08},{"word":"my","start":214.08,"end":214.2},{"word":"breath,","start":214.2,"end":214.46}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":54,"start":214.76,"end":217.54,"textEn":"They could try to force themselves to quit smoking.","textKo":"그들도 억지로 담배를 끊으려 할 수 있었습니다.","words":[{"word":"they","start":214.76,"end":215.12},{"word":"could","start":215.12,"end":215.44},{"word":"try","start":215.44,"end":215.78},{"word":"to","start":215.78,"end":215.94},{"word":"force","start":215.94,"end":216.22},{"word":"themselves","start":216.22,"end":216.6},{"word":"to","start":216.6,"end":216.92},{"word":"quit","start":216.92,"end":217.1},{"word":"smoking.","start":217.1,"end":217.54}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":55,"start":217.98,"end":220.78,"textEn":"And the majority of them had tried this before and failed,","textKo":"그리고 대다수가 이전에 이것을 시도했지만 실패했습니다.","words":[{"word":"And","start":217.98,"end":218.4},{"word":"the","start":218.4,"end":218.5},{"word":"majority","start":218.5,"end":218.84},{"word":"of","start":218.84,"end":219.04},{"word":"them","start":219.04,"end":219.16},{"word":"had","start":219.16,"end":219.46},{"word":"tried","start":219.46,"end":219.74},{"word":"this","start":219.74,"end":219.92},{"word":"before","start":219.92,"end":220.22},{"word":"and","start":220.22,"end":220.38},{"word":"failed,","start":220.38,"end":220.78}],"listenDifficulty":3},{"index":56,"start":220.98,"end":224.9,"textEn":"On average, six times. Now, with mindfulness training,","textKo":"평균 여섯 번이나요. 마음챙김 훈련에서는,","words":[{"word":"on","start":220.98,"end":221.38},{"word":"average,","start":221.38,"end":221.8},{"word":"six","start":222.02,"end":222.32},{"word":"times.","start":222.32,"end":222.7},{"word":"Now,","start":223.8,"end":224.1},{"word":"with","start":224.16,"end":224.26},{"word":"mindfulness","start":224.26,"end":224.58},{"word":"training,","start":224.58,"end":224.9}],"listenDifficulty":1},{"index":57,"start":224.96,"end":228.5,"textEn":"We dropped a bit about forcing and instead focused on being curious.","textKo":"억지로 하는 것을 조금 내려놓고 대신 호기심을 갖는 데 집중했습니다.","words":[{"word":"we","start":224.96,"end":225.12},{"word":"dropped","start":225.12,"end":225.4},{"word":"a","start":225.4,"end":225.56},{"word":"bit","start":225.56,"end":225.66},{"word":"about","start":225.66,"end":225.86},{"word":"forcing","start":225.86,"end":226.32},{"word":"and","start":226.32,"end":226.8},{"word":"instead","start":226.8,"end":227.24},{"word":"focused","start":227.24,"end":227.64},{"word":"on","start":227.64,"end":227.86},{"word":"being","start":227.86,"end":228.08},{"word":"curious.","start":228.08,"end":228.5}],"listenDifficulty":3},{"index":58,"start":229.18,"end":232.16,"textEn":"In fact, we even told them to smoke.","textKo":"사실, 우리는 그들에게 담배를 피우라고까지 했습니다.","words":[{"word":"In","start":229.18,"end":229.78},{"word":"fact,","start":229.78,"end":230.08},{"word":"we","start":230.3,"end":230.7},{"word":"even","start":230.7,"end":230.98},{"word":"told","start":230.98,"end":231.36},{"word":"them","start":231.36,"end":231.56},{"word":"to","start":231.56,"end":231.74},{"word":"smoke.","start":231.74,"end":232.16}],"listenDifficulty":1},{"index":59,"start":232.16,"end":234.3,"textEn":"What? Yeah, we said, go ahead and smoke.","textKo":"뭐라고요? 네, 우리는 말했습니다. 어서 피우세요.","words":[{"word":"What?","start":232.16,"end":232.96},{"word":"Yeah,","start":233.12,"end":233.26},{"word":"we","start":233.34,"end":233.38},{"word":"said,","start":233.38,"end":233.54},{"word":"go","start":233.66,"end":233.72},{"word":"ahead","start":233.72,"end":233.86},{"word":"and","start":233.86,"end":233.98},{"word":"smoke.","start":233.98,"end":234.3}],"listenDifficulty":3},{"index":60,"start":234.52,"end":237.38,"textEn":"Just be really curious about what it''s like when you do.","textKo":"다만 피울 때 어떤 느낌인지 정말 호기심을 가져보세요.","words":[{"word":"Just","start":234.52,"end":234.96},{"word":"be","start":234.96,"end":235.14},{"word":"really","start":235.14,"end":235.4},{"word":"curious","start":235.4,"end":235.8},{"word":"about","start":235.8,"end":236.06},{"word":"what","start":236.06,"end":236.56},{"word":"it''s","start":236.56,"end":236.74},{"word":"like","start":236.74,"end":236.9},{"word":"when","start":236.9,"end":237.06},{"word":"you","start":237.06,"end":237.18},{"word":"do.","start":237.18,"end":237.38}],"listenDifficulty":3},{"index":61,"start":238.02,"end":242.16,"textEn":"And what did they notice? Well, here''s an example from one of our smokers.","textKo":"그리고 그들은 무엇을 알아챘을까요? 우리 흡연자 중 한 명의 사례를 들어보겠습니다.","words":[{"word":"And","start":238.02,"end":238.5},{"word":"what","start":238.5,"end":238.62},{"word":"did","start":238.62,"end":238.72},{"word":"they","start":238.72,"end":238.84},{"word":"notice?","start":238.84,"end":239.18},{"word":"Well,","start":239.76,"end":240.24},{"word":"here''s","start":240.32,"end":240.5},{"word":"an","start":240.5,"end":240.62},{"word":"example","start":240.62,"end":240.98},{"word":"from","start":240.98,"end":241.22},{"word":"one","start":241.22,"end":241.36},{"word":"of","start":241.36,"end":241.46},{"word":"our","start":241.46,"end":241.58},{"word":"smokers.","start":241.58,"end":242.16}],"listenDifficulty":3},{"index":62,"start":242.5,"end":247.46,"textEn":"She said, mindful smoking smells like stinky cheese and tastes like chemicals.","textKo":"그녀는 말했습니다. 마음챙김하며 피우는 담배는 냄새가 고린 치즈 같고 맛은 화학물질 같아요.","words":[{"word":"She","start":242.5,"end":242.94},{"word":"said,","start":242.94,"end":243.16},{"word":"mindful","start":243.24,"end":243.64},{"word":"smoking","start":243.64,"end":244.22},{"word":"smells","start":244.22,"end":245.08},{"word":"like","start":245.08,"end":245.44},{"word":"stinky","start":245.44,"end":245.8},{"word":"cheese","start":245.8,"end":246.18},{"word":"and","start":246.18,"end":246.4},{"word":"tastes","start":246.4,"end":246.72},{"word":"like","start":246.72,"end":246.98},{"word":"chemicals.","start":246.98,"end":247.46}],"listenDifficulty":1},{"index":63,"start":247.8,"end":252.66,"textEn":"Yuck! Now, she knew cognitively that smoking was bad for her.","textKo":"으! 그녀는 인지적으로 흡연이 몸에 해롭다는 것을 알고 있었습니다.","words":[{"word":"Yuck!","start":247.8,"end":248.26},{"word":"Now,","start":249.26,"end":249.84},{"word":"she","start":250.04,"end":250.16},{"word":"knew","start":250.16,"end":250.46},{"word":"cognitively","start":250.46,"end":251.4},{"word":"that","start":251.4,"end":251.56},{"word":"smoking","start":251.56,"end":251.88},{"word":"was","start":251.88,"end":252.06},{"word":"bad","start":252.06,"end":252.28},{"word":"for","start":252.28,"end":252.48},{"word":"her.","start":252.48,"end":252.66}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":64,"start":252.92,"end":259.5,"textEn":"That''s why she joined our program. What she discovered just by being curiously aware when she smoked","textKo":"그래서 우리 프로그램에 참여한 거니까요. 그녀가 담배를 피울 때 호기심 있게 알아차리며 발견한 것은","words":[{"word":"That''s","start":252.92,"end":253.46},{"word":"why","start":253.46,"end":253.58},{"word":"she","start":253.58,"end":253.76},{"word":"joined","start":253.76,"end":254.04},{"word":"our","start":254.04,"end":254.2},{"word":"program.","start":254.2,"end":254.64},{"word":"What","start":255.56,"end":255.86},{"word":"she","start":255.86,"end":256.06},{"word":"discovered","start":256.06,"end":256.7},{"word":"just","start":256.7,"end":257.14},{"word":"by","start":257.14,"end":257.52},{"word":"being","start":257.52,"end":257.8},{"word":"curiously","start":257.8,"end":258.36},{"word":"aware","start":258.36,"end":258.6},{"word":"when","start":258.6,"end":258.84},{"word":"she","start":258.84,"end":259.06},{"word":"smoked","start":259.06,"end":259.5}],"listenDifficulty":1},{"index":65,"start":260.18,"end":262.96,"textEn":"Was that smoking tastes like shit.","textKo":"흡연의 맛이 끔찍하다는 것이었습니다.","words":[{"word":"was","start":260.07,"end":260.36},{"word":"that","start":260.36,"end":260.58},{"word":"smoking","start":260.58,"end":261.12},{"word":"tastes","start":261.12,"end":261.86},{"word":"like","start":261.86,"end":262.4},{"word":"shit.","start":262.4,"end":262.96}],"listenDifficulty":1},{"index":66,"start":266.24,"end":270.16,"textEn":"Now, she moved from knowledge to wisdom.","textKo":"그녀는 지식에서 지혜로 나아갔습니다.","words":[{"word":"Now,","start":266.24,"end":266.82},{"word":"she","start":266.82,"end":267.4},{"word":"moved","start":267.4,"end":267.76},{"word":"from","start":267.76,"end":268.38},{"word":"knowledge","start":268.38,"end":269.38},{"word":"to","start":269.38,"end":269.74},{"word":"wisdom.","start":269.74,"end":270.16}],"listenDifficulty":1},{"index":67,"start":270.42,"end":273.24,"textEn":"She moved from knowing in her head that smoking was bad for her","textKo":"머리로 흡연이 해롭다는 것을 아는 것에서","words":[{"word":"She","start":270.42,"end":270.6},{"word":"moved","start":270.6,"end":270.98},{"word":"from","start":270.98,"end":271.2},{"word":"knowing","start":271.2,"end":271.5},{"word":"in","start":271.5,"end":271.64},{"word":"her","start":271.64,"end":271.74},{"word":"head","start":271.74,"end":271.94},{"word":"that","start":271.94,"end":272.1},{"word":"smoking","start":272.1,"end":272.42},{"word":"was","start":272.42,"end":272.6},{"word":"bad","start":272.6,"end":272.8},{"word":"for","start":272.8,"end":273.02},{"word":"her","start":273.02,"end":273.24}],"listenDifficulty":3},{"index":68,"start":273.24,"end":277.9,"textEn":"To knowing it in her bones. And this spell of smoking was broken.","textKo":"뼛속 깊이 아는 것으로 바뀌었습니다. 그리고 흡연의 주문이 깨졌습니다.","words":[{"word":"to","start":273.24,"end":273.6},{"word":"knowing","start":273.6,"end":274.06},{"word":"it","start":274.06,"end":274.28},{"word":"in","start":274.28,"end":274.48},{"word":"her","start":274.48,"end":274.66},{"word":"bones.","start":274.66,"end":275.2},{"word":"And","start":275.85,"end":276.14},{"word":"this","start":276.14,"end":276.36},{"word":"spell","start":276.36,"end":276.78},{"word":"of","start":276.78,"end":276.96},{"word":"smoking","start":276.96,"end":277.32},{"word":"was","start":277.32,"end":277.56},{"word":"broken.","start":277.56,"end":277.9}],"listenDifficulty":1},{"index":69,"start":278.2,"end":281.2,"textEn":"She started to become disenchanted with her behavior.","textKo":"그녀는 자신의 행동에 대해 환멸을 느끼기 시작했습니다.","words":[{"word":"She","start":278.2,"end":278.46},{"word":"started","start":278.46,"end":278.74},{"word":"to","start":278.74,"end":278.88},{"word":"become","start":278.88,"end":279.16},{"word":"disenchanted","start":279.16,"end":280.1},{"word":"with","start":280.1,"end":280.54},{"word":"her","start":280.54,"end":280.76},{"word":"behavior.","start":280.76,"end":281.2}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":70,"start":282.62,"end":284.92,"textEn":"Now, the prefrontal cortex,","textKo":"전전두엽 피질,","words":[{"word":"Now,","start":282.62,"end":283.2},{"word":"the","start":283.68,"end":283.92},{"word":"prefrontal","start":283.92,"end":284.52},{"word":"cortex,","start":284.52,"end":284.92}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":71,"start":285.08,"end":288.04,"textEn":"That youngest part of our brain from an evolutionary perspective,","textKo":"진화적 관점에서 우리 뇌의 가장 젊은 부분은,","words":[{"word":"that","start":285.08,"end":285.28},{"word":"youngest","start":285.28,"end":285.7},{"word":"part","start":285.7,"end":286.04},{"word":"of","start":286.04,"end":286.18},{"word":"our","start":286.18,"end":286.28},{"word":"brain","start":286.28,"end":286.52},{"word":"from","start":286.52,"end":286.7},{"word":"an","start":286.7,"end":286.86},{"word":"evolutionary","start":286.86,"end":287.34},{"word":"perspective,","start":287.34,"end":288.04}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":72,"start":288.44,"end":292.34,"textEn":"It understands on an intellectual level that we shouldn''t smoke.","textKo":"지적 수준에서 담배를 피우면 안 된다는 것을 이해합니다.","words":[{"word":"it","start":288.44,"end":288.82},{"word":"understands","start":288.82,"end":289.52},{"word":"on","start":289.52,"end":289.88},{"word":"an","start":289.88,"end":290.06},{"word":"intellectual","start":290.06,"end":290.54},{"word":"level","start":290.54,"end":291.06},{"word":"that","start":291.06,"end":291.54},{"word":"we","start":291.54,"end":291.68},{"word":"shouldn''t","start":291.68,"end":292.0},{"word":"smoke.","start":292.0,"end":292.34}],"listenDifficulty":1},{"index":73,"start":292.54,"end":296.08,"textEn":"And it tries its hardest to help us change our behavior,","textKo":"그리고 우리의 행동을 바꾸도록 최선을 다해 돕습니다.","words":[{"word":"And","start":292.54,"end":292.88},{"word":"it","start":292.88,"end":293.02},{"word":"tries","start":293.02,"end":293.4},{"word":"its","start":293.4,"end":293.62},{"word":"hardest","start":293.62,"end":294.18},{"word":"to","start":294.18,"end":294.48},{"word":"help","start":294.48,"end":294.76},{"word":"us","start":294.76,"end":295.0},{"word":"change","start":295.0,"end":295.38},{"word":"our","start":295.38,"end":295.64},{"word":"behavior,","start":295.64,"end":296.08}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":74,"start":296.26,"end":301.74,"textEn":"To help us stop smoking, to help us stop eating that second, that third, that fourth cookie.","textKo":"금연을 돕고, 두 번째, 세 번째, 네 번째 쿠키를 먹지 않도록 돕습니다.","words":[{"word":"to","start":296.26,"end":296.64},{"word":"help","start":296.64,"end":296.84},{"word":"us","start":296.84,"end":297.02},{"word":"stop","start":297.02,"end":297.3},{"word":"smoking,","start":297.3,"end":297.78},{"word":"to","start":297.9,"end":298.0},{"word":"help","start":298.0,"end":298.16},{"word":"us","start":298.16,"end":298.34},{"word":"stop","start":298.34,"end":298.62},{"word":"eating","start":298.62,"end":298.86},{"word":"that","start":298.86,"end":299.1},{"word":"second,","start":299.1,"end":299.58},{"word":"that","start":299.76,"end":299.98},{"word":"third,","start":299.98,"end":300.4},{"word":"that","start":300.64,"end":300.84},{"word":"fourth","start":300.84,"end":301.3},{"word":"cookie.","start":301.3,"end":301.74}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":75,"start":302.54,"end":306.88,"textEn":"We call this cognitive control. We''re using cognition to control our behavior.","textKo":"우리는 이것을 인지적 통제라고 부릅니다. 인지를 사용하여 행동을 통제하는 것입니다.","words":[{"word":"We","start":302.54,"end":303.12},{"word":"call","start":303.12,"end":303.3},{"word":"this","start":303.3,"end":303.46},{"word":"cognitive","start":303.46,"end":303.8},{"word":"control.","start":303.8,"end":304.26},{"word":"We''re","start":304.26,"end":304.5},{"word":"using","start":304.5,"end":304.7},{"word":"cognition","start":304.7,"end":305.4},{"word":"to","start":305.4,"end":305.96},{"word":"control","start":305.96,"end":306.3},{"word":"our","start":306.3,"end":306.5},{"word":"behavior.","start":306.5,"end":306.88}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":76,"start":308.08,"end":310.54,"textEn":"Unfortunately, this is also the first part of our brain","textKo":"안타깝게도, 이것은 스트레스를 받으면","words":[{"word":"Unfortunately,","start":308.08,"end":308.56},{"word":"this","start":308.9,"end":309.06},{"word":"is","start":309.06,"end":309.18},{"word":"also","start":309.18,"end":309.4},{"word":"the","start":309.4,"end":309.58},{"word":"first","start":309.58,"end":309.9},{"word":"part","start":309.9,"end":310.12},{"word":"of","start":310.12,"end":310.26},{"word":"our","start":310.26,"end":310.34},{"word":"brain","start":310.34,"end":310.54}],"listenDifficulty":3},{"index":77,"start":310.54,"end":313.68,"textEn":"That goes offline when we get stressed out, which isn''t that helpful.","textKo":"가장 먼저 작동을 멈추는 뇌의 부분이기도 합니다. 별로 도움이 되지 않죠.","words":[{"word":"that","start":310.54,"end":310.66},{"word":"goes","start":310.66,"end":310.84},{"word":"offline","start":310.84,"end":311.2},{"word":"when","start":311.2,"end":311.44},{"word":"we","start":311.44,"end":311.56},{"word":"get","start":311.56,"end":311.7},{"word":"stressed","start":311.7,"end":311.98},{"word":"out,","start":311.98,"end":312.32},{"word":"which","start":312.64,"end":312.92},{"word":"isn''t","start":312.92,"end":313.16},{"word":"that","start":313.16,"end":313.3},{"word":"helpful.","start":313.3,"end":313.68}],"listenDifficulty":3},{"index":78,"start":314.26,"end":316.56,"textEn":"Now, we can all relate to this in our own experience.","textKo":"우리 모두 자신의 경험에서 이것과 공감할 수 있습니다.","words":[{"word":"Now,","start":314.26,"end":314.58},{"word":"we","start":314.62,"end":314.7},{"word":"can","start":314.7,"end":314.82},{"word":"all","start":314.82,"end":314.94},{"word":"relate","start":314.94,"end":315.3},{"word":"to","start":315.3,"end":315.44},{"word":"this","start":315.44,"end":315.6},{"word":"in","start":315.6,"end":315.74},{"word":"our","start":315.74,"end":315.88},{"word":"own","start":315.88,"end":316.04},{"word":"experience.","start":316.04,"end":316.56}],"listenDifficulty":3},{"index":79,"start":316.8,"end":320.04,"textEn":"We''re much more likely to do things like yell at our spouse or kids","textKo":"스트레스를 받거나 피곤할 때 배우자나 아이들에게 소리를 지르는 것처럼","words":[{"word":"We''re","start":316.8,"end":317.12},{"word":"much","start":317.12,"end":317.32},{"word":"more","start":317.32,"end":317.5},{"word":"likely","start":317.5,"end":317.88},{"word":"to","start":317.88,"end":318.06},{"word":"do","start":318.06,"end":318.2},{"word":"things","start":318.2,"end":318.46},{"word":"like","start":318.46,"end":318.7},{"word":"yell","start":318.7,"end":319.06},{"word":"at","start":319.06,"end":319.2},{"word":"our","start":319.2,"end":319.3},{"word":"spouse","start":319.3,"end":319.6},{"word":"or","start":319.6,"end":319.74},{"word":"kids","start":319.74,"end":320.04}],"listenDifficulty":3},{"index":80,"start":320.04,"end":323.34,"textEn":"When we''re stressed out or tired, even though we know it''s not going to be helpful.","textKo":"도움이 되지 않을 것을 알면서도 그런 행동을 할 가능성이 훨씬 더 높습니다.","words":[{"word":"when","start":320.04,"end":320.28},{"word":"we''re","start":320.28,"end":320.42},{"word":"stressed","start":320.42,"end":320.72},{"word":"out","start":320.72,"end":320.96},{"word":"or","start":320.96,"end":321.1},{"word":"tired,","start":321.1,"end":321.38},{"word":"even","start":321.5,"end":321.7},{"word":"though","start":321.7,"end":321.88},{"word":"we","start":321.88,"end":322.02},{"word":"know","start":322.02,"end":322.28},{"word":"it''s","start":322.28,"end":322.5},{"word":"not","start":322.5,"end":322.62},{"word":"going","start":322.62,"end":322.8},{"word":"to","start":322.8,"end":322.9},{"word":"be","start":322.9,"end":323.0},{"word":"helpful.","start":323.0,"end":323.34}],"listenDifficulty":4},{"index":81,"start":323.64,"end":329.14,"textEn":"We just can''t help ourselves. Now, when the prefrontal cortex goes offline,","textKo":"어쩔 수가 없는 겁니다. 전전두엽 피질이 작동을 멈추면,","words":[{"word":"We","start":323.64,"end":323.92},{"word":"just","start":323.92,"end":324.08},{"word":"can''t","start":324.08,"end":324.36},{"word":"help","start":324.36,"end":324.64},{"word":"ourselves.","start":324.64,"end":325.16},{"word":"Now,","start":326.86,"end":327.34},{"word":"when","start":327.44,"end":327.66},{"word":"the","start":327.66,"end":327.76},{"word":"prefrontal","start":327.76,"end":328.18},{"word":"cortex","start":328.18,"end":328.52},{"word":"goes","start":328.52,"end":328.76},{"word":"offline,","start":328.76,"end":329.14}],"listenDifficulty":1},{"index":82,"start":329.2,"end":331.26,"textEn":"We fall back into our old habits,","textKo":"우리는 옛 습관으로 돌아갑니다.","words":[{"word":"we","start":329.2,"end":329.5},{"word":"fall","start":329.5,"end":329.84},{"word":"back","start":329.84,"end":330.02},{"word":"into","start":330.02,"end":330.26},{"word":"our","start":330.26,"end":330.42},{"word":"old","start":330.42,"end":330.72},{"word":"habits,","start":330.72,"end":331.26}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"index":83,"start":331.26,"end":333.84,"textEn":"Which is why this disenchantment is so important.","textKo":"바로 이것이 환멸이 그토록 중요한 이유입니다.","words":[{"word":"which","start":331.26,"end":331.74},{"word":"is","start":331.74,"end":331.88},{"word":"why","start":331.88,"end":332.02},{"word":"this","start":332.02,"end":332.24},{"word":"disenchantment","start":332.24,"end":332.96},{"word":"is","start":332.96,"end":333.2},{"word":"so","start":333.2,"end":333.38},{"word":"important.","start":333.38,"end":333.84}],"listenDifficulty":2},{"ind