 我感觉我的周末充满的电","pinyin":"Gēn nǐ zhènghǎo xiāngfǎn. Wǒ gǎnjué wǒ de zhōumò chōngmǎn le diàn.","textKo":"너와 정반대야. 주말 동안 충전이 꽉 찬 느낌이야.","words":[{"word":"跟你","start":139.1,"end":139.5},{"word":"正","start":139.5,"end":139.7},{"word":"好","start":139.7,"end":139.84},{"word":"相","start":139.84,"end":140.0},{"word":"反","start":140.0,"end":140.2},{"word":"我","start":140.2,"end":140.9},{"word":"感","start":140.9,"end":141.04},{"word":"觉","start":141.04,"end":141.18},{"word":"我的","start":141.18,"end":141.52},{"word":"周","start":141.52,"end":141.68},{"word":"末","start":141.68,"end":141.92},{"word":"充","start":141.92,"end":142.3},{"word":"满","start":142.3,"end":142.46},{"word":"的","start":142.46,"end":142.56},{"word":"电","start":142.56,"end":142.7}]},{"index":35,"start":142.7,"end":145.48,"textZh":"快说说 你是怎么充电的","pinyin":"Kuài shuōshuo, nǐ shì zěnme chōngdiàn de?","textKo":"빨리 말해봐, 어떻게 충전했어?","words":[{"word":"快","start":142.7,"end":143.48},{"word":"说","start":143.48,"end":143.7},{"word":"说","start":143.7,"end":143.86},{"word":"你是","start":143.86,"end":144.56},{"word":"怎么","start":144.56,"end":144.84},{"word":"充","start":144.84,"end":145.08},{"word":"电","start":145.08,"end":145.28},{"word":"的","start":145.28,"end":145.48}]},{"index":36,"start":146.18,"end":148.4,"textZh":"我的方式可能跟你不太一样","pinyin":"Wǒ de fāngshì kěnéng gēn nǐ bú tài yīyàng.","textKo":"내 방식은 아마 너랑 좀 다를 거야.","words":[{"word":"我的","start":146.18,"end":146.58},{"word":"方","start":146.58,"end":146.78},{"word":"式","start":146.78,"end":147.06},{"word":"可能","start":147.06,"end":147.48},{"word":"跟你","start":147.48,"end":147.78},{"word":"不","start":147.78,"end":147.92},{"word":"太","start":147.92,"end":148.08},{"word":"一","start":148.08,"end":148.28},{"word":"样","start":148.28,"end":148.4}]},{"index":37,"start":148.4,"end":150.42,"textZh":"我喜欢把时间安排好","pinyin":"Wǒ xǐhuān bǎ shíjiān ānpái hǎo.","textKo":"나는 시간을 잘 계획하는 걸 좋아해.","words":[{"word":"我","start":148.4,"end":149.12},{"word":"喜欢","start":149.12,"end":149.36},{"word":"把","st