":158.94}]},{"index":41,"start":159.5,"end":161.62,"textZh":"星期六早上 天气很好","pinyin":"Xīngqīliù zǎoshang, tiānqì hěn hǎo.","textKo":"토요일 아침, 날씨가 좋았어.","words":[{"word":"星","start":159.5,"end":159.9},{"word":"期","start":159.9,"end":160.06},{"word":"六","start":160.06,"end":160.22},{"word":"早","start":160.22,"end":160.4},{"word":"上","start":160.4,"end":160.66},{"word":"天","start":160.66,"end":161.06},{"word":"气","start":161.06,"end":161.24},{"word":"很好","start":161.24,"end":161.62}]},{"index":42,"start":161.62,"end":165.4,"textZh":"我和几个朋友 一起去了我们城市旁边的西山","pinyin":"Wǒ hé jǐ gè péngyǒu, yīqǐ qù le wǒmen chéngshì pángbiān de Xī Shān.","textKo":"친구 몇 명이랑 같이 우리 도시 옆에 있는 시산에 갔어.","words":[{"word":"我","start":161.62,"end":162.26},{"word":"和","start":162.26,"end":162.38},{"word":"几","start":162.38,"end":162.54},{"word":"个","start":162.54,"end":162.64},{"word":"朋友","start":162.64,"end":162.94},{"word":"一起","start":162.94,"end":163.58},{"word":"去了","start":163.58,"end":163.92},{"word":"我们","start":163.92,"end":164.12},{"word":"城","start":164.12,"end":164.3},{"word":"市","start":164.3,"end":164.5},{"word":"旁","start":164.5,"end":164.72},{"word":"边","start":164.72,"end":164.88},{"word":"的","start":164.88,"end":165.0},{"word":"西","start":165.0,"end":165.18},{"word":"山","start":165.18,"end":165.4}]},{"index":43,"start":165.4,"end":167.62,"textZh":"去爬山了吗 哇","pinyin":"Qù pá shān le ma? Wā.","textKo":"등산했어? 와.","words":[{"word":"去","start":165.4,"end":166.06},{"word":"爬","start":166.06,"end":166.26},{"word":"山","start":166.26,"end":166.46},{"word":"了","start":166.46,"end":166.62},{"word":"吗","start":166.62,"end":166.82},{"word":"哇","start":167.22,"end":167.62}]},{"index":44,"start":167.62,"end":170.48,"textZh":"我好久没去爬山了 是啊","pinyin":"Wǒ hǎo jiǔ méi qù pá shān le. Shì a.","textKo":"나 등산 안 한 지 되게 오래됐어. 그래.","words":[{"word":"我","start":167.62,"end":168.16},{"word":"好","start":168.16,"end":168.44},{"word":"久","start":168.44,"end":168.64},{"word":"没","start":168.64,"end":168.78},{"word":"去","start":168.78,"end":168.9},{"word":"爬","start":168.9,"end":169.08},{"word":"山","start":169.08,"end":169.3},{"word":"了","start":169.3,"end":169.5},{"word":"是啊","start":170.08,"end":170.48}]},{"index":45,"start":170.48,"end":173.34,"textZh":"我们爬到山顶 空气特别好","pinyin":"Wǒmen pá dào shāndǐng, kōngqì tèbié hǎo.","textKo":"정상까지 올라갔는데, 공기가 정말 좋았어.","words":[{"word":"我们","start":170.48,"end":171.12},{"word":"爬","start":171.12,"end":171.34},{"word":"到","start":171.34,"end":171.5},{"word":"山","start":171.5,"end":171.72},{"word":"顶","start":171.72,"end":171.96},{"word":"空","start":171.96,"end":172.44},{"word":"气","start":172.44,"end":172.64},{"word":"特","start":172.64,"end":172.86},{"word":"别","start":172.86,"end":173.06},{"word":"好","start":173.06,"end":173.34}]},{"index":46,"start":173.34,"end":176.28,"textZh":"风景也很美 早上爬山","pinyin":"Fēngjǐng yě hěn měi. Zǎoshang pá shān,","textKo":"풍경도 아주 아름답고. 아침에 등산하니까,","words":[{"word":"风","start":173.34,"end":173.76},{"word":"景","start":173.76,"end":173.96},{"word":"也","start":173.96,"end":174.12},{"word":"很","start":174.12,"end":174.3},{"word":"美","start":174.3,"end":174.54},{"word":"早","start":175.24,"end":175.64},{"word":"上","start":175.64,"end":175.82},{"word":"爬","start":175.82,"end":176.06},{"word":"山","start":176.06,"end":176.28}]},{"index":47,"start":176.28,"end":178.64,"textZh":"感觉一整天都特别有精神","pinyin":"gǎnjué yī zhěng tiān dōu tèbié yǒu jīngshén.","textKo":"하루 종일 기운이 넘치더라고.","words":[{"word":"感","start":176.28,"end":176.68},{"word":"觉","start":176.68,"end":176.86},{"word":"一","start":176.86,"end":177.04},{"word":"整","start":177.04,"end":177.24},{"word":"天","start":177.24,"end":177.46},{"word":"都","start":177.46,"end":177.78},{"word":"特","start":177.78,"end":178.0},{"word":"别","start":178.0,"end":178.14},{"word":"有","start":178.14,"end":178.26},{"word":"精","start":178.26,"end":178.44},{"word":"神","start":178.44,"end":178.64}]},{"index":48,"start":178.64,"end":181.8,"textZh":"听起来就很健康 那下午呢","pinyin":"Tīng qǐlái jiù hěn jiànkāng. Nà xiàwǔ ne?","textKo":"듣기만 해도 건강해 보인다. 그럼 오후는?","words":[{"word":"听","start":178.64,"end":179.3},{"word":"起","start":179.3,"end":179.5},{"word":"来","start":179.5,"end":179.62},{"word":"就","start":179.62,"end":179.76},{"word":"很","start":179.76,"end":179.92},{"word":"健","start":179.92,"end":180.1},{"word":"康","start":180.1,"end":180.4},{"word":"那","start":180.4,"end":181.1},{"word":"下","start":181.1,"end":181.44},{"word":"午","start":181.44,"end":181.62},{"word":"呢","start":181.62,"end":181.8}]},{"index":49,"start":182.42,"end":186.32,"textZh":"下午我回家休息了一下 然后去了一个新的咖啡馆","pinyin":"Xiàwǔ wǒ huí jiā xiūxi le yīxià, ránhòu qù le yī gè xīn de kāfēiguǎn.","textKo":"오후에 집에 와서 좀 쉬고, 새로 생긴 카페에 갔어.","words":[{"word":"下","start":182.42,"end":182.82},{"word":"午","start":182.82,"end":182.96},{"word":"我","start":182.96,"end":183.12},{"word":"回","start":183.12,"end":183.3},{"word":"家","start":183.3,"end":183.44},{"word":"休","start":183.44,"end":183.7},{"word":"息","start":183.7,"end":183.86},{"word":"了","start":183.86,"end":183.98},{"word":"一下","start":183.98,"end":184.22},{"word":"然后","start":184.22,"end":184.9},{"word":"去了","start":184.9,"end":185.18},{"word":"一个","start":185.18,"end":185.42},{"word":"新","start":185.42,"end":185.64},{"word":"的","start":185.64,"end":185.8},{"word":"咖","start":185.8,"end":185.98},{"word":"啡","start":185.98,"end":186.12},{"word":"馆","start":186.12,"end":186.32}]},{"index":50,"start":186.78,"end":190.56,"textZh":"那个咖啡馆很安静 我在那里看了一下午的书","pinyin":"Nàge kāfēiguǎn hěn ānjìng. Wǒ zài nàlǐ kàn le yī xiàwǔ de shū.","textKo":"그 카페가 아주 조용했어. 거기서 오후 내내 책을 읽었어.","words":[{"word":"那个","start":186.78,"end":187.18},{"word":"咖","start":187.18,"end":187.42},{"word":"啡","start":187.42,"end":187.56},{"word":"馆","start":187.56,"end":187.7},{"word":"很","start":187.7,"end":187.92},{"word":"安","start":187.92,"end":188.16},{"word":"静","start":188.16,"end":188.38},{"word":"我在","start":188.38,"end":189.12},{"word":"那","start":189.12,"end":189.3},{"word":"里","start":189.3,"end":189.44},{"word":"看","start":189.44,"end":189.7},{"word":"了","start":189.7,"end":189.84},{"word":"一下","start":189.84,"end":190.06},{"word":"午","start":190.06,"end":190.24},{"word":"的","start":190.24,"end":190.34},{"word":"书","start":190.34,"end":190.56}]},{"index":51,"start":190.56,"end":192.86,"textZh":"哇 动静结合","pinyin":"Wā, dòng jìng jiéhé.","textKo":"와, 동정결합이네.","words":[{"word":"哇","start":190.56,"end":191.3},{"word":"动","start":191.3,"end":192.1},{"word":"静","start":192.1,"end":192.36},{"word":"结","start":192.36,"end":192.56},{"word":"合","start":192.56,"end":192.86}]},{"index":52,"start":192.86,"end":196.16,"textZh":"上午运动 下午安静地看书","pinyin":"Shàngwǔ yùndòng, xiàwǔ ānjìng de kàn shū.","textKo":"오전에 운동하고, 오후에 조용히 독서하고.","words":[{"word":"上","start":192.86,"end":193.72},{"word":"午","start":193.72,"end":193.94},{"word":"运","start":193.94,"end":194.18},{"word":"动","start":194.18,"end":194.4},{"word":"下","start":194.4,"end":194.96},{"word":"午","start":194.96,"end":195.22},{"word":"安","start":195.22,"end":195.44},{"word":"静","start":195.44,"end":195.6},{"word":"地","start":195.6,"end":195.7},{"word":"看","start":195.7,"end":195.88},{"word":"书","start":195.88,"end":196.16}]},{"index":53,"start":196.16,"end":200.6,"textZh":"太完美了 你总是能把生活安排得这么好啊","pinyin":"Tài wánměi le. Nǐ zǒng shì néng bǎ shēnghuó ānpái de zhème hǎo a.","textKo":"너무 완벽하다. 넌 항상 생활을 이렇게 잘 계획하더라.","words":[{"word":"太","start":196.16,"end":196.82},{"word":"完","start":196.82,"end":197.1},{"word":"美","start":197.1,"end":197.28},{"word":"了","start":197.28,"end":197.46},{"word":"你","start":197.46,"end":198.14},{"word":"总","start":198.14,"end":198.34},{"word":"是","start":198.34,"end":198.54},{"word":"能","start":198.54,"end":198.66},{"word":"把","start":198.66,"end":198.82},{"word":"生活","start":198.82,"end":199.18},{"word":"安","start":199.18,"end":199.44},{"word":"排","start":199.44,"end":199.66},{"word":"得","start":199.66,"end":199.8},{"word":"这么","start":199.8,"end":200.12},{"word":"好","start":200.12,"end":200.38},{"word":"啊","start":200.38,"end":200.6}]},{"index":54,"start":201.18,"end":205.42,"textZh":"这是一种习惯吧 我觉得周末的时间很宝贵","pinyin":"Zhè shì yī zhǒng xíguàn ba. Wǒ juéde zhōumò de shíjiān hěn bǎoguì.","textKo":"이건 일종의 습관이지. 주말 시간은 소중하니까.","words":[{"word":"这是","start":201.18,"end":201.62},{"word":"一","start":201.62,"end":201.8},{"word":"种","start":201.8,"end":201.94},{"word":"习","start":201.94,"end":202.28},{"word":"惯","start":202.28,"end":202.54},{"word":"吧","start":202.54,"end":202.76},{"word":"我觉得","start":203.48,"end":203.92},{"word":"周","start":203.92,"end":204.16},{"word":"末","start":204.16,"end":204.32},{"word":"的","start":204.32,"end":204.42},{"word":"时间","start":204.42,"end":204.64},{"word":"很","start":204.64,"end":204.9},{"word":"宝","start":204.9,"end":205.16},{"word":"贵","start":205.16,"end":205.42}]},{"index":55,"start":205.42,"end":208.36,"textZh":"要好好利用 那星期天","pinyin":"Yào hǎohǎo lìyòng. Nà xīngqītiān?","textKo":"잘 활용해야 해. 그럼 일요일은?","words":[{"word":"要","start":205.42,"end":205.92},{"word":"好好","start":205.92,"end":206.26},{"word":"利","start":206.26,"end":206.44},{"word":"用","start":206.44,"end":206.66},{"word":"那","start":207.22,"end":207.66},{"word":"星","start":207.66,"end":207.98},{"word":"期","start":207.98,"end":208.14},{"word":"天","start":208.14,"end":208.36}]},{"index":56,"start":208.36,"end":210.74,"textZh":"我上午去超市买了很多菜","pinyin":"Wǒ shàngwǔ qù chāoshì mǎi le hěn duō cài.","textKo":"오전에 마트에 가서 채소를 많이 샀어.","words":[{"word":"我","start":208.36,"end":209.08},{"word":"上","start":209.08,"end":209.26},{"word":"午","start":209.26,"end":209.42},{"word":"去","start":209.42,"end":209.58},{"word":"超","start":209.58,"end":209.8},{"word":"市","start":209.8,"end":210.02},{"word":"买","start":210.02,"end":210.2},{"word":"了","start":210.2,"end":210.3},{"word":"很多","start":210.3,"end":210.5},{"word":"菜","start":210.5,"end":210.74}]},{"index":57,"start":210.74,"end":213.64,"textZh":"买菜 你要自己做饭吗","pinyin":"Mǎi cài? Nǐ yào zìjǐ zuò fàn ma?","textKo":"장을 봤어? 직접 요리하려고?","words":[{"word":"买","